ng attempt''s own\n  timeout (130s budget -> at most 2 real attempts, ~121s worst\n  case) so slow lookups stay bounded instead of stacking to 190s\n\nCo-authored-by: CommandCodeBot <noreply@commandcode.ai>","tree":{"sha":"b57884882c43fb4e1323eaa6f5a6934fd41b7ad1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/git/trees/b57884882c43fb4e1323eaa6f5a6934fd41b7ad1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/git/commits/07109e7cc99d4a952d40e33ef656f2670847bac7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95760812?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nayaksomkar","id":95760812,"login":"nayaksomkar","node_id":"U_kgDOBbUxrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commit/07109e7cc99d4a952d40e33ef656f2670847bac7","node_id":"C_kwDOUPfCvNoAKDA3MTA5ZTdjYzk5ZDRhOTUyZDQwZTMzZWY2NTZmMjY3MDg0N2JhYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commit/9e00529c6ccc85ff1eee7c1ca3a53fda9264751f","sha":"9e00529c6ccc85ff1eee7c1ca3a53fda9264751f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commits/9e00529c6ccc85ff1eee7c1ca3a53fda9264751f"}],"sha":"07109e7cc99d4a952d40e33ef656f2670847bac7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commits/07109e7cc99d4a952d40e33ef656f2670847bac7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95760812?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nayaksomkar","id":95760812,"login":"nayaksomkar","node_id":"U_kgDOBbUxrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commits/9e00529c6ccc85ff1eee7c1ca3a53fda9264751f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:11:16Z","email":"nayaksomkar@outlook.in","name":"Nayak Omkar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:11:16Z","email":"nayaksomkar@outlook.in","name":"Nayak Omkar"},"message":"fix(orchestrator): preserve requested metrics, harden upstream data handling\n\nMarket-share preservation (root fix):\n- LookupProfile gains marketShare/growthRate (float | None) — the\n  extraction values were previously dropped before reaching the\n  answer block; None means unavailable, never fabricated 0\n- _to_lookup_competitor carries them via new _optional_float\n- _lookup_to_competitor and _profile_dict_from_lookup keep the\n  values through refine-merge and the 24h eviction cache\n- Single non-zero market share is no longer rescaled to 100%:\n  redistribution now requires >=2 non-zero shares (a lone value\n  is that company''s share, not the whole market)\n\nEntity/question alignment:\n- _detect_metric maps \"market share\"/\"pricing\"/\"funding\" questions\n  onto the corresponding WebHunter §5.1 query templates, so the\n  requested metric drives the research query\n- _requested_metric_gap reports a requested-but-unavailable metric\n  in missing_data (info) instead of silently dropping it\n- answer.question now echoes the user''s question on question intents\n\nWebHunter client (orchestrator side only; legacy service untouched):\n- search_company sends the documented bounding params (max_pages 5,\n  timeout_ms 30000) — without them thin-result entities blocked >90s\n- per-attempt lookup timeout 45s (evidence: successful crawls take\n  27-43s; the old 30s truncated real responses)\n- 80s total retry budget: fast transient failures still retry per\n  §7.1, slow ones stop early instead of stalling the request\n- upstream-reported failures raise (retryable) with the real cause\n  instead of masquerading as \"no results\"\n- _dedupe_sources prefers sources mentioning the requested company;\n  non-matching results are kept after them, not dropped\n\nLLMPing output hardening:\n- non-dict market_info degrades to {} instead of crashing\n  response construction; scalar gaps/opportunities/risks no longer\n  iterate into single characters\n\nDocs/cleanup in DOCKER.md table (revert of an accidental reword).\n\nCo-authored-by: CommandCodeBot <noreply@commandcode.ai>","tree":{"sha":"7e365573888b4052c1845be1c595746aba440f87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/git/trees/7e365573888b4052c1845be1c595746aba440f87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/git/commits/9e00529c6ccc85ff1eee7c1ca3a53fda9264751f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95760812?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nayaksomkar","id":95760812,"login":"nayaksomkar","node_id":"U_kgDOBbUxrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commit/9e00529c6ccc85ff1eee7c1ca3a53fda9264751f","node_id":"C_kwDOUPfCvNoAKDllMDA1MjljNmNjYzg1ZmYxZWVlN2MxY2EzYTUzZmRhOTI2NDc1MWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commit/3017eb5756dbcb515445d6fd8999c2be845ef23d","sha":"3017eb5756dbcb515445d6fd8999c2be845ef23d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commits/3017eb5756dbcb515445d6fd8999c2be845ef23d"}],"sha":"9e00529c6ccc85ff1eee7c1ca3a53fda9264751f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commits/9e00529c6ccc85ff1eee7c1ca3a53fda9264751f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95760812?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nayaksomkar","id":95760812,"login":"nayaksomkar","node_id":"U_kgDOBbUxrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commits/3017eb5756dbcb515445d6fd8999c2be845ef23d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:10:18Z","email":"nayaksomkar@outlook.in","name":"Nayak Omkar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:10:18Z","email":"nayaksomkar@outlook.in","name":"Nayak Omkar"},"message":"fix(deploy): bake deployed upstream URLs into the Render image\n\nRender builds the Docker image with no dashboard env vars set, so the\ndeployed orchestrator ran with empty LLMPING_URL/WEBHUNTER_URL and its\nlocal/Docker-only discovery could never find the Render upstreams —\nevery parser/execute request returned\n\"LLMPing URL not configured and no candidate answered\".\n\nAdd the public service URLs as Dockerfile ENV defaults so the running\ndeployment talks straight to the deployed LLMPing/WebHunter. Dashboard\nenv vars still override these defaults.\n\nCo-authored-by: CommandCodeBot <noreply@commandcode.ai>","tree":{"sha":"bfb849bca5160075dde230d1b40e71d6565873eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/git/trees/bfb849bca5160075dde230d1b40e71d6565873eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/git/commits/3017eb5756dbcb515445d6fd8999c2be845ef23d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"