n evicted_entities, 24h evicted-profile cache\n- Reference resolution (§8.3): focus pronouns, \"the cheaper one\"\n  (lowest priceMonthly), \"the leader\" (marketPosition)\n- Chart derivation (PARSER.md §10) from real marketShare/growthRate/\n  pricing/featureAdoption data; marketShare normalized to sum 100\n- LLMPing client: extract_profile/explain/compare task adapters with\n  JSON parsing; WebHunter client: per-company search with domain\n  dedup\n- Intent handlers for bootstrap, question/follow-up, refine (add/\n  remove with eviction), compare, explain, regenerate\n- Tests: 89 passing — updated parser-flow tests to the new contract,\n  new §5 flow/eviction/derivation/normalization suites, wire-level\n  contract tests for the new client methods, API envelope tests\n\nVerified end-to-end against in-process fake upstreams: bootstrap,\nmixed context+lookup compare, explain, and refine-with-eviction all\nreturn the documented §6.1 envelope over real HTTP.\n\nCo-authored-by: CommandCodeBot <noreply@commandcode.ai>","tree":{"sha":"3e77266aa528bf180f3111ab8d762c0af109c7ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/git/trees/3e77266aa528bf180f3111ab8d762c0af109c7ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/git/commits/5363ee61ae5c511abd20c32becdf19f1f1e2d014","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95760812?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nayaksomkar","id":95760812,"login":"nayaksomkar","node_id":"U_kgDOBbUxrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/orgs","rec