s://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commit/20b42bd718781643869748315230394e5eef081c","node_id":"C_kwDOUPfCvNoAKDIwYjQyYmQ3MTg3ODE2NDM4Njk3NDgzMTUyMzAzOTRlNWVlZjA4MWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commit/9466c0eeefcdfb82ec9608c1683afb89b08186be","sha":"9466c0eeefcdfb82ec9608c1683afb89b08186be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commits/9466c0eeefcdfb82ec9608c1683afb89b08186be"}],"sha":"20b42bd718781643869748315230394e5eef081c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commits/20b42bd718781643869748315230394e5eef081c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95760812?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nayaksomkar","id":95760812,"login":"nayaksomkar","node_id":"U_kgDOBbUxrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commits/9466c0eeefcdfb82ec9608c1683afb89b08186be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T21:05:28Z","email":"nayaksomkar@outlook.in","name":"Nayak Omkar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T21:05:28Z","email":"nayaksomkar@outlook.in","name":"Nayak Omkar"},"message":"fix(orchestrator): bridge drifted upstream contracts\n\nLLMPing''s `/chat` expects `{query, session_id}`; we were sending\n`{task, context, required_outputs}`. WebHunter''s `/research` expects\n`{query, max_results}`; we were sending `{business, research_types}`.\nBoth upstreams returned 422, so every real parser call landed as\n`status=\"error\"` and the UI thought the orchestrator was dead.\n\nThis commit:\n\n- `LLMPingClient`: add `_build_query()` that collapses the internal\n  payload (`task`, `context`, `message`, `current_context`,\n  `fresh_research`) into the single `query` string LLMPing wants, and\n  `_adapt_response()` that exposes LLMPing''s `{answer, provider,\n  model}` reply under the keys the orchestrator already reads\n  (`business_summary`, `executive_summary`, `report`).\n\n- `WebHunterClient`: switch from the dead `/api/v1/scrape` endpoint\n  to the live `/research/sync` endpoint, add `_build_query()` that\n  flattens business profile + research topics into a single natural\n  language query, and `_adapt_response()` that maps the upstream''s\n  `{search_results, crawled_contents, stats}` reply into the\n  `{results: {<topic>: {sources, crawled, query, stats}}}` shape the\n  orchestrator''s `_sanitize_sources()` already consumes. Async\n  failures (`status=\"failed\"`, `error` set) return an empty result\n  instead of raising.\n\n- `Orchestrator._build_analysis_result`: drop the `LLMPingError`\n  raise when structured keys are missing — partial responses now\n  produce a `partial` `AnalysisResult` with `business_summary`\n  populated from the reply text. Transport errors still raise.\n\n- 60 tests pass, including 5 new in-process contract tests that\n  assert the wire payload actually has `query`/`session_id` and\n  `query`/`max_results` — so future contract drift breaks CI, not\n  production.\n\nCo-authored-by: CommandCodeBot <noreply@commandcode.ai>","tree":{"sha":"2f450b9780ac3d2bdd39d38b292267a624f6549b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/git/trees/2f450b9780ac3d2bdd39d38b292267a624f6549b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/git/commits/9466c0eeefcdfb82ec9608c1683afb89b08186be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95760812?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nayaksomkar","id":95760812,"login":"nayaksomkar","node_id":"U_kgDOBbUxrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commit/9466c0eeefcdfb82ec9608c1683afb89b08186be","node_id":"C_kwDOUPfCvNoAKDk0NjZjMGVlZWZjZGZiODJlYzk2MDhjMTY4M2FmYjg5YjA4MTg2YmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commit/b5cd5240505904cb3d5366934e9efbe20b57a103","sha":"b5cd5240505904cb3d5366934e9efbe20b57a103","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commits/b5cd5240505904cb3d5366934e9efbe20b57a103"}],"sha":"9466c0eeefcdfb82ec9608c1683afb89b08186be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commits/9466c0eeefcdfb82ec9608c1683afb89b08186be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95760812?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nayaksomkar","id":95760812,"login":"nayaksomkar","node_id":"U_kgDOBbUxrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/commits/b5cd5240505904cb3d5366934e9efbe20b57a103/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T20:45:20Z","email":"nayaksomkar@outlook.in","name":"Nayak Omkar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T20:45:20Z","email":"nayaksomkar@outlook.in","name":"Nayak Omkar"},"message":"feat(orchestrator): dynamic upstream service discovery\n\nReplace fail-fast container startup with lazy URL resolution so\nCompetitorEngine can boot without `LLMPING_URL` / `WEBHUNTER_URL`\nand find its siblings at runtime.\n\n- New `app/services/discovery.py`: probes a candidate list (host.docker.internal, plain DNS names, localhost) and returns the first reachable URL. Any HTTP response counts as healthy — we only check reachability.\n- `app/config.py`: drop the init-time `RuntimeError`; add `REQUIRE_SERVICE_URLS=true` as an opt-in fail-fast escape hatch plus discovery overrides.\n- `LLMPingClient` / `WebHunterClient`: drop init-time raise; resolve URLs lazily on first call, cache the result, and clear the cache on connection error so the next call retries discovery.\n- `Orchestrator.__init__`: fire-and-forget resolution pass; expose `get_resolved_upstreams()` for the FastAPI `/` endpoint.\n- `app/main.py`: lifespan resolves at startup; `/` reports `upstream_resolved: {llmping, webhunter}` and `discovery.enabled`.\n- Tests: 24 new unit tests covering discovery candidates, lazy resolution, cache invalidation, and orchestrator wiring. All 55 tests pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: CommandCodeBot <noreply@commandcode.ai>","tree":{"sha":"f3833bfa3bf36ec6fafa95814dd7052f1d291e4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/git/trees/f3833bfa3bf36ec6fafa95814dd7052f1d291e4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/git/commits/b5cd5240505904cb3d5366934e9efbe20b57a103","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95760812?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nayaksomkar","id":95760812,"login":"nayaksomkar","node_id":"U_kgDOBbUxrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url