ING_URL\n  - WebHunterClient: single HTTP client for research via WEBHUNTER_URL\n  - New POST /api/v1/chat endpoint with session_id delegation\n  - Existing POST /api/v1/analyze preserved (contract same, field set expanded)\n  - Settings fail-fast if either upstream URL is unset\n  - Charts/metric cards with empty data are dropped (never fabricated)\n  - All 8 old agents and 2 old service clients removed\n  - config.json trimmed to just service{} + cors{}\n  - Service URLs come exclusively from env vars\n\n13/13 tests pass; Docker build verified.\n\nCo-authored-by: CommandCodeBot <noreply@commandcode.ai>","tree":{"sha":"d5f9114b087ca3b2ee5dcfc2f507db7574c5f274","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/git/trees/d5f9114b087ca3b2ee5dcfc2f507db7574c5f274"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nayaksomkar/CompetitorEngine/git/commits/c3a18aa65dc08c49aaf948f0245756d2823a4456","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95760812?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nayaksomkar","id":95760812,"login":"nayaksomkar","node_id":"U_kgDOBbUxrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayaksomkar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"h