halupa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FilipChalupa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FilipChalupa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FilipChalupa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FilipChalupa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FilipChalupa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FilipChalupa/wakeword-trainer/commits/4ada353b6076e415030aae0ad2687483e4ef5def/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T18:54:05Z","email":"chalupa.filip@gmail.com","name":"Filip Chalupa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T18:54:05Z","email":"chalupa.filip@gmail.com","name":"Filip Chalupa"},"message":"Step bar, empty states, storage overview, throw-away test instance with an e2e script\n\n- ProgressSteps under the tabs (samples, training, test, deployment); Test and Deploy say what to do when\n  there is no model yet\n- GET /api/storage with the datasets, the feature cache and every project; the Data tab shows it and can\n  empty the trash or the feature cache\n- docker-compose.test.yml + scripts/e2e.sh (port 8100, ./data-test): smoke test, and with --screenshots demo\n  samples (scripts/demo_data.py), a short training and the README screenshots; the smoke test covers the step\n  bar, the empty state and the microphone test dialog\n- speech bounds: the noise term is capped so edge-to-edge speech is reported as cut, not silent\n- README screenshots re-created\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mwW5uuf87uarJwAHJoZbF","tree":{"sha":"5c5d61f41adb158dcb4a261b6bb3187c4eee1e8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FilipChalupa/wakeword-trainer/git/trees/5c5d61f41adb158dcb4a261b6bb3187c4eee1e8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FilipChalupa/wakeword-trainer/git/commits/4ada353b6076e415030aae0ad2687483e4ef5def",