job\n\nEvery Postgres integration test already boots its own testcontainers Postgres (outboxDB / per-package helpers); nothing reads DATABASE_URL. Job name unchanged (required status check).\n\n* test(arch): add TestPostgresIntegrationTestsUseTestcontainers sensor\n\nFails on DATABASE_URL/ANALYTICS_DATABASE_URL env gates, t.Skip tied to them, or pgx/database-sql integration tests without a testcontainers postgres helper in the package. Includes a bad-fixture detection test.","tree":{"sha":"4d24a2716e801f7f0be7c826463285be878128ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/process-path-management/git/trees/4d24a2716e801f7f0be7c826463285be878128ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/process-path-management/git/commits/ffc7ab859e5df1eaba402a9d9af52cdc025dca1a","verification":{"payload":"tree 4d24a2716e801f7f0be7c826463285be878128ff\nparent 392382b445837ccfa7af479f410f176d3fa84945\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791248986 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791248986 -0300\n\ntest: Tier-1 audit fixes — testcontainers sensor + CI cleanup (#103)\n\n* ci: drop unused Postgres service and DATABASE_URL from integration job\n\nEvery Postgres integration test already boots its own testcontainers Postgres (outboxDB / per-package helpers); nothing reads DATABASE_URL. Job name unchanged (required status check).\n\n* test(arch): add TestPostgresIntegrationTestsUseTestcontainers sensor\n\nFails on DATABASE_URL/ANALYTICS_DATABASE_URL env gates, t.Skip tied to them, or pgx/database-sql integration tests without a testcontainers postgres helper in the package. Includes a bad-fixture detection test.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxEpaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyokQACosb7l/5vpbsSWaGQsj+WTZ\n6UdX4GmWjbCXkM7fHNsX8IZZ66V1oMLje1BS+zu4I/wWNPPThp9nc0L2MXq9Duvi\nb++eGDcpSBwoJnnPWncb0dwiEf+y01DaOWxe1vdR9QCq+pxsboQXjnYugkKtn78S\n+f8Z5uaVBZH/23cgSAuAElSRF7rMx6RVOxsw38sGyTD7D7Hhe6bU786dNN6UHyDZ\nKMRG5DICf/KwX