oed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/process-path-management/commits/d16673450a268c3094da9d83b9c93d336ac66522/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T01:34:39Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T01:34:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ci): add weekly continuous-drift sensor (#49)\n\nAdapted from inventory-storage''s already-merged reference (PR #77):\na new `drift` job gated to `workflow_dispatch`/`schedule` only, so it\nnever blocks a PR. Runs four advisory checks and appends each to the\njob summary:\n\n- dead code (`go tool deadcode -test ./...`)\n- stale go.mod entries (`go mod tidy -diff`)\n- unused frontend exports/deps in `web/` (`knip --no-exit-code`)\n- coverage-quality: cross-references `go tool cover -func` against\n  gremlins'' LIVED-mutant output to flag high-coverage functions that\n  still have a surviving mutant (tests execute the line but assert\n  nothing on it)\n\n`scripts/coverage-quality.py` is copied verbatim from\ninventory-storage (same coverage gate, 90%, same gremlins version\npinned in CI).","tree":{"sha":"17159a6ea88ba04f0697abd232f1b5c84e8b68d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/process-path-management/git/trees/17159a6ea88ba04f0697abd232f1b5c84e8b68d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/process-path-management/git/commits/d16673450a268c3094da9d83b9c93d336ac66522","verification":{"payload":"tree 17159a6ea88ba04f0697abd232f1b5c84e8b68d3\nparent d1a1ee85c50f9d2334c414bf161cf5d3176942e4\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1789436079 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789436079 -0300\n\nfeat(ci): add weekly continuous-drift sensor (#49)\n\nAdapted from inventory-storage''s already-merged reference (PR #77):\na new `drift` job gated to `workflow_dispatch`/`schedule` only, so it\nnever blocks a PR. Runs four advisory checks and appends each to the\njob summary:\n\n- dead code (`go tool deadcode -test ./...`)\n- stale go.mod entries (`go mod tidy -diff`)\n- unused frontend exports/deps in `web/` (`knip --no-exit-code`)\n- coverage-quality: cross-references `go tool cover -func` against\n  gremlins'' LIVED-mutant output to flag high-coverage functions that\n  still have a surviving mutant (tests execute the line but assert\n  nothing on it)\n\n`scripts/coverage-quality.py` is copied verbatim from\ninventory-storage (same coverage gate, 90%, same gremlins version\npinned in CI).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqKCvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtJoQAHd1gONB9xOxq0izhxk+xxae\nNSAyLgpJMVbxgNRyvbp+OWCI24yC7ArOHk025qfwR/rYWIx0N+qT2IyvFtC7tLd1\nTDZkaP1mpShTxXc5qaf3hBmvZ79CUxT4vl/UJyVuTWRJHt9X/YhjDpc87qqZjVvK\nHlW1jwEdC4a5cLtG4ApX6ZRWzXirQw9q7ZtbwUSw2lN39PmKV/XMio79g7Xp097o\nXbFPDmPp5fa88vahF/0r+FQ+iw3FlOwYgz6iTqPTyBqt1VRJWMRdf53H3GFMmr89\nrZTXastipE+qyo4dcu2ZEt/HIxSAEjIifz8NpL18CIOyn9ukPobjNp0zi/5C4KvM\nnTAQmRuQcwqgeLA6FAlX9Yra6fGdGSkQMyd3GQW4IQ/b4ptYPL3YCKc8eiVyywxq\njMh2zi20OcAY8njVANCWee/2DTVOV7zMnfaOb7Rh4CoU+M3gHiSKp27rOLIc9Tkq\n6X85FDk5YRNoHMR0kUvFxfy9Pfd2sKK49iK9QTIOLtpNG5cnjS9vQTjEPGpxQ69P\nblA1X1xrVc/sWbO2UkDBneRZ+liOSNd/8HdS45i5U/6dlCBt5VAXJNdeIBcLorqu\n0DW/6qG0NIJCvH6aNr9+lP/A0U+qYQCUREjyg8GaHdLfTn4AobgkFp4JrcDYXQs1\nnlC7BDP9OuEnVjmI41CP\n=GocV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-15T01:34:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_i