"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Braulio2002/examen-hce-clinica-san-felipe/commits/4157d48c505ad7afa0d8d8f9f9eb26211b7e7415/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T09:48:47Z","email":"braulioxdlavado@gmail.com","name":"Braulio Nario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T09:48:47Z","email":"braulioxdlavado@gmail.com","name":"Braulio Nario"},"message":"test: pruebas unitarias del dominio (29 casos)\r\n\r\nCubren el value object Importe -la formula de importes del enunciado y el\r\nmargen de 1.35- y las reglas del agregado de inventario. Se ejecutan sin\r\nbase de datos ni contenedores.","tree":{"sha":"f840daf73b0e58c399b7e57082112467d3c3e9f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Braulio2002/examen-hce-clinica-san-felipe/git/trees/f840daf73b0e58c399b7e57082112467d3c3e9f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Braulio2002/examen-hce-clinica-san-felipe/git/commits/4157d48c505ad7afa0d8d8f9f9eb26211b7e7415","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107601988?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Braulio2002","id":107601988,"login":"Braulio2002","node_id":"U_kgDOBmngRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Braulio2002/examen-hce-clinica-san-felipe/commit/4157d48c505ad7afa0d8d8f9f9eb26211b7e7415","node_id":"C_kwDOUPuyitoAKDQxNTdkNDhjNTA1YWQ3YWZhMGQ4ZDhmOWY5ZWIyNjIxMWI3ZTc0MTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Braulio2002/examen-hce-clinica-san-felipe/commit/ff616f29da5aa8c01a253bd3992bb7b517d970ee","sha":"ff616f29da5aa8c01a253bd3992bb7b517d970ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Braulio2002/examen-hce-clinica-san-felipe/commits/ff616f29da5aa8c01a253bd3992bb7b517d970ee"}],"sha":"4157d48c505ad7afa0d8d8f9f9eb26211b7e7415","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Braulio2002/examen-hce-clinica-san-felipe/commits/4157d48c505ad7afa0d8d8f9f9eb26211b7e7415"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107601988?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Braulio2002","id":107601988,"login":"Braulio2002","node_id":"U_kgDOBmngRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Braulio2002","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Braulio2002/examen-hce-clinica-san-felipe/commits/ff616f29da5aa8c01a253bd3992bb7b517d970ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T09:47:15Z","email":"braulioxdlavado@gmail.com","name":"Braulio Nario"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T09:47:15Z","email":"braulioxdlavado@gmail.com","name":"Braulio Nario"},"message":"feat: sistema de gestion de insumos medicos HCE\r\n\r\nSolucion completa al examen tecnico de Especialista de Desarrollo HCE.\r\n\r\nBase de datos (SQL Server)\r\n- Modelo de 7 tablas del enunciado mas usuarios, tipos de movimiento y auditoria\r\n- Stock derivado de la tabla de movimientos: unica fuente de verdad\r\n- Procedimientos almacenados con Table-Valued Parameters para los 8 servicios\r\n- Triggers de auditoria en JSON con usuario de aplicacion via SESSION_CONTEXT\r\n- Trigger de integridad que impide stock negativo y bitacora inmutable\r\n- Bateria de 10 pruebas de reglas de negocio (10/10 en verde)\r\n\r\nBackEnd (NestJS, microservicios, Docker)\r\n- API Gateway con JWT de 30 min en cookie HttpOnly, roles, rate limit, CORS,\r\n  Helmet y Swagger\r\n- Tres microservicios por bounded context: auth, catalogo e inventario\r\n- Arquitectura hexagonal: el dominio no importa NestJS ni el driver de BD\r\n- Patrones Facade y Decorator; principios SOLID\r\n- Validacion de stock con bloqueo dentro de la transaccion\r\n\r\nFrontEnd (Next.js, microfront)\r\n- Multi-Zones: shell y zona de inventario como aplicaciones independientes\r\n- Interceptores de Axios para JWT y expiracion de sesion\r\n- Pantallas de compra (con modal de alta de producto), venta (con validacion\r\n  de stock) y Kardex (con modal de movimientos y saldo acumulado)\r\n- Tailwind CSS, responsivo para tablet y laptop clinica\r\n\r\nInfraestructura y verificacion\r\n- docker-compose con orden de arranque por healthchecks\r\n- Prueba de humo end-to-end de 36 verificaciones (36/36 en verde)\r\n- Coleccion de Postman y documentacion de arquitectura","tree":{"sha":"75df3d14fa2bf44f175a76a78066e9e8212ee14a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Braulio2002/exa