x CD smoke test: cd-tools image had curl removed after installing kubectl/helm\n\nThe first real CD deploy succeeded completely (rollout, image\nverification, all pods healthy) and still reported FAILURE purely\nbecause the Smoke test stage''s curl call hit \"curl: not found\" -\ncurl had been deliberately removed right after downloading kubectl/\nhelm to shrink the image, without accounting for Jenkinsfile-cd''s own\nlater use of it. v1.0.2 keeps curl installed.","tree":{"sha":"b4105d64bfdaa9523d376f58d921b6e6b8237f76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/trees/b4105d64bfdaa9523d376f58d921b6e6b8237f76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/commits/f90eeb81e43bf5bb5d805200472fe607479011c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46001177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73","id":46001177,"login":"davidso73","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDAxMTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73/Devops-Project/commit/f90eeb81e43bf5bb5d805200472fe607479011c4","node_id":"C_kwDOUP0t79oAKGY5MGVlYjgxZTQzYmY1YmI1ZDgwNTIwMDQ3MmZlNjA3NDc5MDE