 live - every Deployment/Service/\nConfigMap/ServiceAccount/NetworkPolicy/Ingress in devops-app has the\nsame stale annotations. Loop over all of them before helm upgrade\n--install instead of fixing one resource kind at a time as each new\none surfaces.","tree":{"sha":"74e4bb51845d5dcc75e7156533a919b3bab8da53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/trees/74e4bb51845d5dcc75e7156533a919b3bab8da53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/commits/93b0453ccb704873dd7a82f029e70b8e66049198","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46001177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73","id":46001177,"login":"davidso73","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDAxMTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73/Devops-Project/commit/93b0453ccb704873dd7a82f029e70b8e66049198","node_id":"C_kwDOUP0t79oAKDkzYjA0NTNjY2I3MDQ4NzNkZDdhODJmMDI5ZTcwYjhlNjYwNDkxOTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73/Devops-Project/commit/4ec13b2772ba9f429c75e1c948d51abbcc83c333","sha":"4ec13b2772ba9f429c75e1c948d51abbcc83c333","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/4ec13b2772ba9f429c75e1c948d51abbcc83c333"}],"sha":"93b0453ccb704873dd7a82f029e70b8e66049198","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/93b0453ccb704873dd7a82f029e70b8e66049198"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46001177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73","id":46001177,"login":"davidso73","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDAxMTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/4ec13b2772ba9f429c75e1c948d51abbcc83c333/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T07:28:48Z","email":"david.sosi@gmail.com","name":"David"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T07:28:48Z","email":"david.sosi@gmail.com","name":"David"},"message":"Fix first real CD deploy: broken kubectl binary + namespace ownership\n\n- agent-images/cd-tools/Dockerfile: the original EKS S3 URL for kubectl\n  pinned a build date that doesn''t exist for v1.31.0; curl without -f\n  silently saved the resulting S3 XML error page as the \"binary\" with\n  exit 0. Switched to the canonical dl.k8s.io release URL and added -f\n  everywhere so a bad download fails the build. Bumped to v1.0.1 since\n  ECR''s immutable tags meant v1.0.0 couldn''t be overwritten.\n- Jenkinsfile-cd: the app''s Helm chart owns a Namespace resource, and\n  devops-app already existed from an earlier manual install under a\n  different release name - helm upgrade --install refused to adopt it\n  (invalid ownership metadata). Deploy stage now aligns the namespace''s\n  Helm ownership annotations first, every run, idempotently.\n- rbac/cd-agent-rbac.yaml: added \"patch\" (not create/delete) on\n  namespaces, scoped to exactly what the annotation-alignment step needs.","tree":{"sha":"19a52ac1428981074367d75adb33f324096dca9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/trees/19a52ac1428981074367d75adb33f324096dca9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/commits/4ec13b2772ba9f429c75e1c948d51abbcc83c333","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46001177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73","id":46001177,"login":"davidso73","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDAxMTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73/Devops-Project/commit/4ec13b2772ba9f429c75e1c948d51abbcc83c333","node_id":"C_kwDOUP0t79oAKDRlYzEzYjI3NzJiYTlmNDI5Yzc1ZTFjOTQ4ZDUxYWJiY2M4M2MzMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73/Devops-Project/commit/b15f2d0a508f6aa80d948d0ff3dc7564a4202bb6","sha":"b15f2d0a508f6aa80d948d0ff3dc7564a4202bb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/b15f2d0a508f6aa80d948d0ff3dc7564a4202bb6"}],"sha":"4ec13b2772ba9f429c75e1c948d51abbcc83c333","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/4ec13b2772ba9f429c75e1c948d51abbcc83c333"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46001177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73","id":46001177,"login":"davidso73","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDAxMTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/b15f2d0a508f6aa80d948d0ff3dc7564a4202bb6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T07:17:39Z","email":"david.sosi@gmail.com","name":"David"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T07:17:39Z","email":"david.sosi@gmail.com","name":"David"},"message":"Fix CD never auto-triggering: BRANCH_NAME is unset on a plain pipelineJob\n\napplication-ci is a plain (not Multibranch) pipelineJob hardcoded to\nbranch(''main'') - see seed-job.groovy''s documented trade-off for why.\nenv.BRANCH_NAME is a Multibranch-only variable and was always null\nhere, so `if (env.BRANCH_NAME == ''main'')` silently never triggered CD\non any successful build. This job only ever builds main by\nconstruction, so success here always means trigger CD.","tree":{"sha":"06527320d1ac135d46f45f6c048cc5468f9c49ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/trees/06527320d1ac135d46f45f6c048cc5468f9c49ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/commits/b15f2d0a508f6aa80d948d0ff3dc7564a4202bb6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46001177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73","id":46001177,"login":"davidso73","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDAxMTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73/Devops-Project/commit/b15f2d0a508f6aa80d948d0ff3dc7564a4202bb6","node_id":"C_kwDOUP0t79oAKGIxNWYyZDBhNTA4ZjZhYTgwZDk0OGQwZmYzZGM3NTY0YTQyMDJiYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73/Devops-Project/commit/df4ea806decd61ea7bd84e49687dcd1c96fd203a","sha":"df4ea806decd61ea7bd84e49687dcd1c96fd203a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/df4ea806decd61ea7bd84e49687dcd1c96fd203a"}],"sha":"b15f2d0a508f6aa80d948d0ff3dc7564a4202bb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/b15f2d0a508f6aa80d948d0ff3dc7564a4202bb6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46001177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73","id":46001177,"login":"davidso73","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDAxMTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/df4ea806decd61ea7bd84e49687dcd1c96fd203a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T07:13:49Z","email":"david.sosi@gmail.com","name":"David"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T07:13:49Z","email":"david.sosi@gmail.com","name":"David"},"message":"Allow agent egress on port 80 and DNS - apt-get needs HTTP, not just HTTPS\n\nThe worker image''s Dockerfile installs procps via apt, which uses\nDebian''s default HTTP (not HTTPS) mirrors - 443-only egress left\n\"Unable to locate package\" (the index never downloaded), confirmed\nlive on the first build to get this far.","tree":{"sha":"a1e116b981afa40a471c67c7d424c4dadde88bc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/trees/a1e116b981afa40a471c67c7d424c4dadde88bc2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/commits/df4ea806decd61ea7bd84e49687dcd1c96fd203a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46001177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73","id":46001177,"login":"davidso73","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDAxMTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73/Devops-Project/commit/df4ea806decd61ea7bd84e49687dcd1c96fd203a","node_id":"C_kwDOUP0t79oAKGRmNGVhODA2ZGVjZDYxZWE3YmQ4NGU0OTY4N2RjZDFjOTZmZDIwM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73/Devops-Project/commit/60ee4cccd14d4313ce994082c2b1a3613a5cdc1c","sha":"60ee4cccd14d4313ce994082c2b1a3613a5cdc1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/60ee4cccd14d4313ce994082c2b1a3613a5cdc1c"}],"sha":"df4ea806decd61ea7bd84e49687dcd1c96fd203a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/df4ea806decd61ea7bd84e49687dcd1c96fd203a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46001177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73","id":46001177,"login":"davidso73","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDAxMTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/60ee4cccd14d4313ce994082c2b1a3613a5cdc1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T07:08:59Z","email":"david.sosi@gmail.com","name":"David"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T07:08:59Z","email":"david.sosi@gmail.com","name":"David"},"message":"Fix BuildKit rootless flag not reaching buildkitd at all\n\nBUILDKITD_FLAGS (the commonly-documented env var for this image) is\nnever actually read by its entrypoint - confirmed live via\n/proc/<pid>/cmdline showing buildkitd started with zero arguments\ndespite the env var being set, which is what caused every real build''s\nfirst RUN step to fail mounting /proc (default process-sandbox mode\nneeds privileges this pod doesn''t grant). Passing the same flag via\nthe container''s args instead, which the entrypoint does forward.","tree":{"sha":"68b3ff0d5a484b2f814025a7496dcfa478364d3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/trees/68b3ff0d5a484b2f814025a7496dcfa478364d3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/commits/60ee4cccd14d4313ce994082c2b1a3613a5cdc1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46001177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73","id":46001177,"login":"davidso73","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDAxMTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73/Devops-Project/commit/60ee4cccd14d4313ce994082c2b1a3613a5cdc1c","node_id":"C_kwDOUP0t79oAKDYwZWU0Y2NjZDE0ZDQzMTNjZTk5NDA4MmMyYjFhMzYxM2E1Y2RjMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73/Devops-Project/commit/286f2aa83985bca6bde8edfff688ffabf0bd7f16","sha":"286f2aa83985bca6bde8edfff688ffabf0bd7f16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/286f2aa83985bca6bde8edfff688ffabf0bd7f16"}],"sha":"60ee4cccd14d4313ce994082c2b1a3613a5cdc1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/60ee4cccd14d4313ce994082c2b1a3613a5cdc1c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46001177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73","id":46001177,"login":"davidso73","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDAxMTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/286f2aa83985bca6bde8edfff688ffabf0bd7f16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:57:12Z","email":"david.sosi@gmail.com","name":"David"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:57:12Z","email":"david.sosi@gmail.com","name":"David"},"message":"Fix ECR manifest push (needs Docker v2 schema2, not OCI media types)\n\nbuildctl''s default OCI-mediatype manifest got rejected by ECR with a\nbare 400 Bad Request on the final PUT, confirmed after layers uploaded\nsuccessfully - oci-mediatypes=false on the buildctl --output fixes it.","tree":{"sha":"2e4b84e1112065cea7a9e554f114a9fb9e1d5423","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/trees/2e4b84e1112065cea7a9e554f114a9fb9e1d5423"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/commits/286f2aa83985bca6bde8edfff688ffabf0bd7f16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46001177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73","id":46001177,"login":"davidso73","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDAxMTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73/Devops-Project/commit/286f2aa83985bca6bde8edfff688ffabf0bd7f16","node_id":"C_kwDOUP0t79oAKDI4NmYyYWE4Mzk4NWJjYTZiZGU4ZWRmZmY2ODhmZmFiZjBiZDdmMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73/Devops-Project/commit/e23a4d9c4a68fcc7a81c20ef84dbfda6033ad124","sha":"e23a4d9c4a68fcc7a81c20ef84dbfda6033ad124","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/e23a4d9c4a68fcc7a81c20ef84dbfda6033ad124"}],"sha":"286f2aa83985bca6bde8edfff688ffabf0bd7f16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/286f2aa83985bca6bde8edfff688ffabf0bd7f16"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46001177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73","id":46001177,"login":"davidso73","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDAxMTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/e23a4d9c4a68fcc7a81c20ef84dbfda6033ad124/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:49:19Z","email":"david.sosi@gmail.com","name":"David"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:49:19Z","email":"david.sosi@gmail.com","name":"David"},"message":"Fix ECR token leaking into CI build logs; grant BuildKit CAP_SYS_ADMIN\n\nJenkins'' sh step echoes every command with a + prefix by default, which\nwas printing the ECR authorization token in plain text into the build\nconsole - readable by any authenticated user under this project''s\nJob/Read matrix permission. set +x/-x now brackets exactly the lines\nthat touch the token.\n\nAlso: rootless BuildKit''s nested build steps need CAP_SYS_ADMIN to\nmount their own /proc, confirmed by the first real image build failing\nwith \"operation not permitted\" even after the earlier SETUID/SETGID\nfix - a capability excluded from the bounding set stays unavailable\neven to \"root\" inside BuildKit''s own user namespace.","tree":{"sha":"9e02fdb19895f35cc7bc8ffac4a2c2a4a89784d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/trees/9e02fdb19895f35cc7bc8ffac4a2c2a4a89784d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/commits/e23a4d9c4a68fcc7a81c20ef84dbfda6033ad124","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46001177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73","id":46001177,"login":"davidso73","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDAxMTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73/Devops-Project/commit/e23a4d9c4a68fcc7a81c20ef84dbfda6033ad124","node_id":"C_kwDOUP0t79oAKGUyM2E0ZDljNGE2OGZjYzdhODFjMjBlZjg0ZGJmZGE2MDMzYWQxMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73/Devops-Project/commit/5cdef404b4c9b608103faff3271768e191e907b1","sha":"5cdef404b4c9b608103faff3271768e191e907b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/5cdef404b4c9b608103faff3271768e191e907b1"}],"sha":"e23a4d9c4a68fcc7a81c20ef84dbfda6033ad124","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/e23a4d9c4a68fcc7a81c20ef84dbfda6033ad124"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46001177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73","id":46001177,"login":"davidso73","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDAxMTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/5cdef404b4c9b608103faff3271768e191e907b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:40:49Z","email":"david.sosi@gmail.com","name":"David"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:40:49Z","email":"david.sosi@gmail.com","name":"David"},"message":"Fix agent pod scheduling/build failures found running the first real CI build\n\n- Shrink CI/CD agent container resource requests and override the\n  Kubernetes plugin''s default jnlp container size - the 2-node free-tier\n  cluster didn''t have room for the original requests (FailedScheduling:\n  Insufficient memory).\n- Grant the BuildKit container allowPrivilegeEscalation: true and add back\n  SETUID/SETGID to its otherwise-fully-dropped capability set: rootless\n  BuildKit''s rootlesskit needs newuidmap/newgidmap (setuid-root binaries)\n  to build its user namespace, and both no_new_privs and an empty\n  capability bounding set independently block that - confirmed by the\n  literal \"operation not permitted\" failure with either alone.\n- Install app/backend''s real requirements.txt before running pytest in CI;\n  the CI tools image only ships flake8/pytest/awscli, and the test module\n  imports the actual app code (psycopg2 et al).\n- Document all three as trade-offs/security-relevant decisions in README.","tree":{"sha":"f2c2cad9f5bda051cabe3f790a1cb4c90058a607","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/trees/f2c2cad9f5bda051cabe3f790a1cb4c90058a607"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/commits/5cdef404b4c9b608103faff3271768e191e907b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46001177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73","id":46001177,"login":"davidso73","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDAxMTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73/Devops-Project/commit/5cdef404b4c9b608103faff3271768e191e907b1","node_id":"C_kwDOUP0t79oAKDVjZGVmNDA0YjRjOWI2MDgxMDNmYWZmMzI3MTc2OGUxOTFlOTA3YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73/Devops-Project/commit/5b03c018823e5b290de3a403b68fb38a319213b9","sha":"5b03c018823e5b290de3a403b68fb38a319213b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/5b03c018823e5b290de3a403b68fb38a319213b9"}],"sha":"5cdef404b4c9b608103faff3271768e191e907b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/5cdef404b4c9b608103faff3271768e191e907b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46001177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidso73","id":46001177,"login":"davidso73","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDAxMTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidso73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/commits/5b03c018823e5b290de3a403b68fb38a319213b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:27:20Z","email":"david.sosi@gmail.com","name":"David"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T06:27:20Z","email":"david.sosi@gmail.com","name":"David"},"message":"Add Jenkins CI/CD on EKS, driven entirely from code via JCasC\n\nJenkins controller + dynamic CI/CD agent pods on the same vmapp-eks\ncluster, separate jenkins namespace, least-privilege RBAC per agent,\nIRSA for ECR push, BuildKit-rootless builds, Jenkinsfile-ci (test/lint/\nbuild/scan/push, no deploy) and Jenkinsfile-cd (helm upgrade/rollout/\nverify/smoke-test, no build), both jobs created from committed Job DSL\nvia JCasC + a CLI-based create-jobs.sh fallback. Adds a basic pytest\nsuite and flake8 config for the backend (none existed), plus the EBS\nCSI driver/StorageClass and CI-agent IRSA role the Jenkins install\nneeds on top of the existing EKS stack.","tree":{"sha":"d9f64474ae1f74f9f3010ddcb156a6f17cfbaed2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/trees/d9f64474ae1f74f9f3010ddcb156a6f17cfbaed2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidso73/Devops-Project/git/commits/5b03c018823e5b290de3a403b68fb38a319213b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46001177?v=4","events_url":"http