6Z","email":"sagrawal486@gmail.com","name":"Shivam Agrawal"},"message":"docs: project instructions, design decisions, and a real README\n\n- CLAUDE.md: standing decisions (goal, working agreement, cost rules, stack,\n  architecture, roadmap) so they don''t need re-explaining every session\n- docs/DESIGN_DECISIONS.md: the ''why'' behind every non-obvious choice --\n  chunking strategy trade-offs, why pgvector over a dedicated vector DB, what\n  every cost-control setting bounds and why, plus three real bugs found and\n  fixed with the full investigation (pgvector class-name detection, Nova\n  Micro refusing first-person questions, the Bedrock inference-profile\n  requirement) -- and a guided debug-mode walkthrough\n- README.md: full rewrite to match what''s actually built (was describing a\n  backend-only, chat-provider-not-wired-in state); Docker quick start,\n  manual setup, Mermaid architecture diagram, full API table, env var guide\n  including the Bedrock inference-profile gotcha\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9904ef4ed71258cf464319e770d247022f8d0013","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sagrawal486/PDFChatBot/git/trees/9904ef4ed71258cf464319e770d247022f8d0013"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sagrawal486/PDFChatBot/git/commits/a279f644e7c7aad7b0bf945592e5a1d7188f59b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38691048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sagrawal486","id":38691048,"login":"sagrawal486","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NjkxMDQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/use