,"user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sagrawal486/PDFChatBot/commits/dbe8984dd85899026d06afa55bb8dddc892c56f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:57:11Z","email":"sagrawal486@gmail.com","name":"Shivam Agrawal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:57:11Z","email":"sagrawal486@gmail.com","name":"Shivam Agrawal"},"message":"feat(frontend): Next.js app -- auth, documents, chat with citations\n\nScaffolded with create-next-app (App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind v4, React 19,\n--empty template, no extra UI libraries).\n\n- AuthProvider context: register/login/logout, JWT in localStorage, AuthGuard\n  redirects unauthenticated users to /login\n- Documents page: upload, list, delete, status badge polling every 3s while\n  uploaded/processing\n- Chat page: ask a question, see the answer plus a collapsible citations list\n  (document, page number, score, excerpt); 429 daily-limit handled with a\n  clear message\n- lib/api.ts: typed fetch client matching the backend contract exactly (JSON\n  register, form-encoded login per OAuth2PasswordRequestForm) -- verified\n  against the live backend, not just typed against the schema\n- NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL via frontend/.env.local (see .env.local.example);\n  defaults line up with the backend''s CORS_ORIGINS default (localhost:3000)\n\nVerified: npm run lint and npm run build both clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5039ac017a24c7352532feef4d7cddccd621e06d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sagrawal486/PDFChatBot/git/trees/5039ac017a24c7352532feef4d7cddccd621e06d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sagrawal486/PDFChatBot/git/commits/dbe8984dd85899026d06afa55bb8dddc892c56f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38691048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/events{/pri