m/users/sagrawal486/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sagrawal486/PDFChatBot/commits/80fbc2bf4797188ecc3e1264115eb07ed9e040f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:56:50Z","email":"sagrawal486@gmail.com","name":"Shivam Agrawal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:56:50Z","email":"sagrawal486@gmail.com","name":"Shivam Agrawal"},"message":"feat(infra): full Docker Compose stack + GitHub Actions CI\n\n- docker/Dockerfile: one image for both api and worker (compose picks the\n  command); pip install has retries/timeout since it hit a flaky-network\n  IncompleteRead mid-build\n- docker-compose.yml now runs postgres (pgvector/pgvector:pg16, was plain\n  postgres:16, which can''t run the vector migration), redis, api, and worker.\n  api runs ''alembic upgrade head'' on start so ''docker compose up'' alone is a\n  working demo. Healthchecks + depends_on: condition: service_healthy so\n  api/worker don''t race postgres/redis startup. Shared uploads_data volume\n  since api and worker are separate containers/filesystems.\n  Defaults to CHAT_PROVIDER=simple / STORAGE_BACKEND=local: the whole stack\n  runs with zero AWS credentials.\n- .env.example documents every setting with safe defaults, including the\n  apac.* Bedrock inference-profile gotcha (Nova models reject bare model IDs\n  for on-demand invocation in most regions)\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml: pytest + compileall + a Docker build smoke test,\n  on every branch push and PR\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31ab78b807e6cf3dc148d42cd666eca10df8de36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sagrawal486/PDFChatBot/git/trees/31ab78b807e6cf3dc148d42cd666eca10df8de36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sagrawal486/PDFChatBot/git/commits/80fbc2bf4797188ecc3e1264115eb07ed9e040f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38691048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sagrawal486","id":38691048,"login":"sagrawal486","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NjkxMDQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sagrawal486/PDFChatBot/commit/80fbc2bf4797188ecc3e1264115eb07ed9e040f6","node_id":"C_kwDOUP1Z49oAKDgwZmJjMmJmNDc5NzE4OGVjYzNlMTI2NDExNWViMDdlZDllMDQwZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sagrawal486/PDFChatBot/commit/46105ed0cd89be97cf5be93180d89fa6b43ffafc","sha":"46105ed0cd89be97cf5be93180d89fa6b43ffafc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sagrawal486/PDFChatBot/commits/46105ed0cd89be97cf5be93180d89fa6b43ffafc"}],"sha":"80fbc2bf4797188ecc3e1264115eb07ed9e040f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sagrawal486/PDFChatBot/commits/80fbc2bf4797188ecc3e1264115eb07ed9e040f6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38691048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sagrawal486","id":38691048,"login":"sagrawal486","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NjkxMDQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sagrawal486/PDFChatBot/commits/46105ed0cd89be97cf5be93180d89fa6b43ffafc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:56:38Z","email":"sagrawal486@gmail.com","name":"Shivam Agrawal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T17:56:38Z","email":"sagrawal486@gmail.com","name":"Shivam Agrawal"},"message":"feat(backend): real Bedrock answers, pgvector search, page citations, cost controls\n\n- chat_provider: BedrockChatProvider now actually calls the Converse API (was\n  previously always falling back to returning raw context); system prompt fixed\n  to stop refusing first-person questions like ''what is my email'' (verified\n  against the live model)\n- document_repository: fix pgvector detection (compared against the string\n  ''Vector'' but the real SQLAlchemy class is ''VECTOR'' -- always failed, silently\n  wrote embeddings as JSON strings, which then crashed pgvector''s own bind\n  processor); computed once as USES_PGVECTOR and reused instead of re-derived\n- search_similar_chunks now runs cosine-distance ranking in Postgres (HNSW\n  index) instead of loading every chunk into Python\n- page-aware chunking: TextChunker/PdfDocumentProcessor now chunk per page and\n  track page_number, so /questions citations can point at a real page\n- documents: GET (list/one) and DELETE endpoints, both owner-scoped\n- cost controls: MAX_CHUNKS_PER_DOCUMENT caps embedding cost per document,\n  EMBEDDING_CONCURRENCY batches Bedrock calls concurrently, MAX_QUESTIONS_PER_DAY\n  (question_logs table + DailyQuestionLimiter) rate-limits Bedrock chat calls,\n  429 when exceeded\n- CORS support, requirements.txt fixed from UTF-16 to UTF-8 (+ added pgvector)\n- migrations: pgvector extension + HNSW index, page_number column, question_logs\n  table; migrations/env.py was missing the QuestionLog import for autogenerate\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fefd23d9de67a64a8646bf02f7d668b287f372f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sagrawal486/PDFChatBot/git/trees/fefd23d9de67a64a8646bf02f7d668b287f372f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sagrawal486/PDFChatBot/git/commits/46105ed0cd89be97cf5be93180d89fa6b43ffafc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38691048?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sagrawal486","id":38691048,"login":"sagrawal486","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NjkxMDQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sagrawal486/repos","site_admin":false,"st