":"websterwh16@gmail.com","name":"William"},"message":"Flatten workers/worker to worker/\n\nThere''s only one Worker now, so a plural workers/ directory wrapping a\nsingle folder literally named \"worker\" was redundant. Move it to the\nrepo root next to page/ instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HfaStgU9JpiYKj3KKfC1u9","tree":{"sha":"9871cea4332b9e4e0a0c4f6645e7118b525b4f89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/websterwh/breaker-box/git/trees/9871cea4332b9e4e0a0c4f6645e7118b525b4f89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/websterwh/breaker-box/git/commits/a157097d42214c43d1e8acb3dea8112e1cc55ec2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81191122?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/websterwh","id":81191122,"login":"websterwh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTkxMTIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/websterwh/breaker-box/commit/a157097d42214c43d1e8acb3dea8112e1cc55ec2","node_id":"C_kwDOUP27ENoAKGExNTcwOTdkNDIyMTRjNDNkMWU4YWNiM2RlYTgxMTJlMWNjNTVlYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/websterwh/breaker-box/commit/ab8179136ae12ac0d5268c9ffb9eb322feb1a1a4","sha":"ab8179136ae12ac0d5268c9ffb9eb322feb1a1a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/websterwh/breaker-box/commits/ab8179136ae12ac0d5268c9ffb9eb322feb1a1a4"}],"sha":"a157097d42214c43d1e8acb3dea8112e1cc55ec2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/websterwh/breaker-box/commits/a157097d42214c43d1e8acb3dea8112e1cc55ec2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81191122?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/websterwh","id":81191122,"login":"websterwh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTkxMTIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/websterwh/breaker-box/commits/ab8179136ae12ac0d5268c9ffb9eb322feb1a1a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T00:06:06Z","email":"websterwh16@gmail.com","name":"William"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T00:06:06Z","email":"websterwh16@gmail.com","name":"William"},"message":"Consolidate proxy-worker and maintenance-worker into one Worker; add Update Worker Code\n\n- workers/worker/ replaces the two separate Workers. It serves site\n  traffic / the MODE-driven maintenance page as before, and now also\n  relays the plugin''s Cloudflare API calls under /__bbproxy/*, so one\n  Worker and one deploy button covers both jobs.\n- Plugin: Settings now has a single \"Worker URL\" field (replaces \"Proxy\n  Worker URL\"), plus an \"Update Worker Code\" action that pushes the\n  plugin''s bundled copy of the Worker source to your deployed Worker.\n  It reads back existing bindings first and re-submits them unchanged,\n  since Cloudflare''s docs don''t specify whether omitting bindings on a\n  code-only update preserves or wipes existing secrets.\n- page/scripts/copy-worker-source.mjs embeds workers/worker/src/index.js\n  into the plugin build so there''s a single source of truth for the code.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HfaStgU9JpiYKj3KKfC1u9","tree":{"sha":"1c1add36f9c6dc0c443faa7ff10e1894c0b9252c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/websterwh/breaker-box/git/trees/1c1add36f9c6dc0c443faa7ff10e1894c0b9252c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/websterwh/breaker-box/git/commits/ab8179136ae12ac0d5268c9ffb9eb322feb1a1a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81191122?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/websterwh","id":81191122,"login":"websterwh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTkxMTIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/websterwh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"