24398/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SampleUser13924398/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SampleUser13924398/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SampleUser13924398/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SampleUser13924398","id":48535081,"login":"SampleUser13924398","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NTM1MDgx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SampleUser13924398/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SampleUser13924398/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SampleUser13924398/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SampleUser13924398/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SampleUser13924398/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SampleUser13924398","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pramalin/msw-demo/commits/0ef6bc26c3cd3d68ae6c2c29a9a6e10ab53cecce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T04:49:58Z","email":"demo@example.com","name":"MSW Demo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T04:49:58Z","email":"demo@example.com","name":"MSW Demo"},"message":"MSW demo: mocking a real backend that was unreachable in the lower environment\n\nModels the actual blocker hit on the Module Federation POC: identity\nrecords missing in the lower env, then zero seeded access requests even\nafter that was fixed. MSW intercepts /api/access-requests in the browser\nand serves success/empty/slow/error scenarios on demand, with a live\non/off toggle so you can see exactly what ''no backend available'' looks\nlike to the app without mocking.\n\nIncludes: interactive demo app, MSW v2 handlers, a diagram of the\ninterception mechanism, and screenshots of every state.","tree":{"sha":"2c3c10ecb23eb29e9d78b7429b95b961444f4a8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pramalin/msw-demo/git/trees/2c3c10ecb23