bscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngoyal16","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/divmora/show-and-tell/commit/8237d3c233891741a7248a8fb310faa5a0b70807","node_id":"C_kwDOUQG4R9oAKDgyMzdkM2MyMzM4OTE3NDFhNzI0OGE4ZmIzMTBmYWE1YTBiNzA4MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/divmora/show-and-tell/commit/afca669f766ee6cfef79cb68ecc61d6fd758d800","sha":"afca669f766ee6cfef79cb68ecc61d6fd758d800","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divmora/show-and-tell/commits/afca669f766ee6cfef79cb68ecc61d6fd758d800"}],"sha":"8237d3c233891741a7248a8fb310faa5a0b70807","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divmora/show-and-tell/commits/8237d3c233891741a7248a8fb310faa5a0b70807"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10145666?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngoyal16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngoyal16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngoyal16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngoyal16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ngoyal16","id":10145666,"login":"ngoyal16","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTQ1NjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngoyal16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngoyal16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngoyal16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngoyal16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngoyal16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngoyal16","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divmora/show-and-tell/commits/afca669f766ee6cfef79cb68ecc61d6fd758d800/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T07:01:55Z","email":"nitingoyal.dev@gmail.com","name":"Nitin Goyal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T07:01:55Z","email":"nitingoyal.dev@gmail.com","name":"Nitin Goyal"},"message":"feat(tools): screen annotation & telestrator drawing tools (#16)\n\nAdd high-performance in-page screen annotation overlay with Shadow DOM encapsulation:\n- In-page transparent high-DPI canvas overlay with isolated open Shadow DOM (<show-and-tell-telestrator>)\n- Freehand pen with smooth interpolation and multi-color palette (red, yellow, blue, green)\n- Vector arrow tool with precise geometric arrowhead for calling out UI elements\n- Disappearing ink mode fading out strokes smoothly after 3s via requestAnimationFrame\n- 1-click Clear button and hotkey (Alt+Shift+X) to wipe canvas annotations\n- Global keyboard shortcuts (Alt+Shift+A to toggle telestrator, Alt+Shift+X to clear)\n- Dual capture support: natively captured in Pixel mode, serialized as drawing events in DOM session replay\n- DOM replayer & standalone HTML player canvas replay with timeline seek and scrub sync\n- React useShowAndTell hook bindings and types in @divmora/show-and-tell-react\n- Interactive controls and hotkey badges in demo playground","tree":{"sha":"be031e5b1c8867931b705c1f5f018785600d02b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divmora/show-and-tell/git/trees/be031e5b1c8867931b705c1f5f018785600d02b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divmora/show-and-tell/git/commits/afca669f766ee6cfef79cb68ecc61d6fd758d800","verification":{"payload":"tree be031e5b1c8867931b705c1f5f018785600d02b0\nparent b1f3f0905f187ed7267bf2380d33f9403c40ae23\nauthor Nitin Goyal <nitingoyal.dev@gmail.com> 1789974115 +0530\ncommitter Nitin Goyal <nitingoyal.dev@gmail.com> 1789974115 +0530\n\nfeat(tools): screen annotation & telestrator drawing tools (#16)\n\nAdd high-performance in-page screen annotation overlay with Shadow DOM encapsulation:\n- In-page transparent high-DPI canvas overlay with isolated open Shadow DOM (<show-and-tell-telestrator>)\n- Freehand pen with smooth interpolation and multi-color palette (red, yellow, blue, green)\n- Vector arrow tool with precise geometric arrowhead for calling out UI elements\n- Disappearing ink mode fading out strokes smoothly after 3s via requestAnimationFrame\n- 1-click Clear button and hotkey (Alt+Shift+X) to wipe canvas annotations\n- Global keyboard shortcuts (Alt+Shift+A to toggle telestrator, Alt+Shift+X to clear)\n- Dual capture support: natively captured in Pixel mode, serialized as drawing events in DOM session replay\n- DOM replayer & standalone HTML player canvas replay with timeline seek and scrub sync\n- React useShowAndTell hook bindings and types in @divmora/show-and-tell-react\n- Interactive controls and hotkey badges in demo playground\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCAAdFiEETlZhMiBUcj2k7+IFqFZ9oFfmbyEFAmqw1mMACgkQqFZ9oFfm\nbyHHxxAAjhk2KxLQnocgqnEjoDXQYtPGtHwynj2y066mHsu218BxaXab+p/WhjtO\n73eXdsoY3of/HcrKbp1alX+NCArhYRN3tiqtW3inrpzdwNwBk6qEt2CGlQ8CeAtV\nc8SVgm7CiEYahrFmQzQrpzx2izeXQh9E1AtFMcqFM/59CfHWkIHJ/O9EMnmVTQhg\nEd2DqV4WqDYWJJDBrGKY7QWMKrWvDpYTvsGnP6YJ2cES0L2YrB52AphYclhHuT6i\nXv4RWeWuroLHkvSGy5JYeZe3xhH7FeiDsI5ZYfQpk0S7LVOW0J0W/WAvU+wYm2YE\n3hyEI1p/Bwm4fxFvpOa8Yp2RUgPR0NtrpcEhttyUwqENnAUuQghtYiDwCut7RNft\ngv8hbFHxnwxJOT8D8LeH1It5UHQ0kDkdo/3ALO+WjZ6SqREMnDEzCH21U46J/IKm\nO9ROMC9kHRY7V87xjHXEBFNTDqI/3exfnQicyAXtvVqoNU7ry5OV7jtmb+rJSK0z\n8XpVy085L+FgkmOwOUGJGQb5+VdNBXPUA4AXQhze0MVUThDFfaI60s8qf/yyUCUf\nl4Ig5XOm4ULWUyO5hPCEwf9+JWi+KQbLuxt0UwEc00n2Nc4p5AtNV+e5cngmXeiM\nN9Klf9AM3lOVg6k+OqnRxKSx2R5I2hudGYHf3cu2IapdldMNqY0=\n=gO6W\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-21T07:04:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10145666?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngoyal16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngoyal16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngoyal16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngoyal16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ngoyal16","id":10145666,"login":"ngoyal16