thub.com/users/ngoyal16","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divmora/show-and-tell/commits/b1f3f0905f187ed7267bf2380d33f9403c40ae23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T12:08:08Z","email":"nitingoyal.dev@gmail.com","name":"Nitin Goyal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T12:08:08Z","email":"nitingoyal.dev@gmail.com","name":"Nitin Goyal"},"message":"feat(ux): global keyboard shortcuts and hands-free recording hotkeys (#15)\n\n- Implemented HotkeyManager with configurable shortcut combinations for start/stop, pause/resume, mic mute, camera bubble toggle, spotlight toggle, and discard.\n- Added input collision protection ignoring hotkeys when typing in editable elements (input, textarea, select, contenteditable) with configurable opt-out.\n- Added macOS Option/dead-key compatibility matching KeyboardEvent.code and platform-aware symbol formatting (e.g. ⌥⇧R vs Alt+Shift+R).\n- Enhanced RecordingWidget with dynamic hotkey tooltips and reactive button state updates.\n- Added session.discard() for immediate teardown and storage cleanup bypassing post-recording modal.\n- Exposed registerHotkeys, unregisterHotkeys, and getGlobalHotkeys on ShowAndTell and React hook useShowAndTell.\n- Added 23 unit tests in packages/sdk and comprehensive tests in packages/react.\n- Integrated hotkey controls into the interactive demo playground.","tree":{"sha":"b51366aa700d73ba1d5ce895f4a432c0201acd07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divmora/show-and-tell/git/trees/b51366aa700d73ba1d5ce895f4a432c0201acd07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divmora/show-and-tell/git/commits/b1f3f0905f187ed7267bf2380d33f9403c40ae23","verification":{"payload":"tree b51366aa700d73ba1d5ce895f4a432c0201acd07\nparent c6ac3499e8d2419c4ad7ec11a47731a91074d7a6\nauthor Nitin Goyal <nitingoyal.dev@gmail.com> 1789819688 +0530\ncommitter Nitin Goyal <nitingoyal.dev@gmail.com> 1789819688 +0530\n\nfeat(ux): global keyboard shortcuts and hands-free recording hotkeys (#15)\n\n- Implemented HotkeyManager with configurable shortcut combinations for start/stop, pause/resume, mic mute, camera bubble toggle, spotlight toggle, and discard.\n- Added input collision protection ignoring hotkeys when typing in editable elements (input, textarea, select, contenteditable) with configurable opt-out.\n- Added macOS Option/dead-key compatibility matching KeyboardEvent.code and platform-aware symbol formatting (e.g. ⌥⇧R vs Alt+Shift+R).\n- Enhanced RecordingWidget with dynamic hotkey tooltips and reactive button state updates.\n- Added session.discard() for immediate teardown and storage cleanup bypassing post-recording modal.\n- Exposed registerHotkeys, unregisterHotkeys, and getGlobalHotkeys on ShowAndTell and React hook useShowAndTell.\n- Added 23 unit tests in packages/sdk and comprehensive tests in packages/react.\n- Integrated hotkey controls into the interactive demo playground.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCAAdFiEETlZhMiBUcj2k7+IFqFZ9oFfmbyEFAmqueygACgkQqFZ9oFfm\nbyGt0Q/+JGjE8pTO/KkVupD5uQ9kVkNng193DlcX0/JSsNaPa4ziLOK5dvs/kOsG\nF2tTzZ2/5UD8Bqui8iqBYPJOvzuxh3a6jgioNQ3sCgJqA8BdyspHGHSe5hUOzIp7\nv1OhG1m3vV8AsmUcqG9XHsJjRwKG6KAtUMxF/nD7Y1IBOC8/938/1TletwbQPQ1N\n+pS7rAqdqz7yYG7DKDwqcalqKbBROy7prw0AoaJ76JyiqCeN5SeuHds1VUZzRaF3\nW3UddPi09T8BRR8MWl+qbwl2d9PfU1E+iKLkO2Gt4NmUH6ZhE6LoyxDYOUQSND42\n2MwfhA8icze2w42Y/LAmjDQrPGwkml9NAPSeedOVVSYWkJ6iOyj0VQHT6XMAiQlu\nMQ0UfHlZ5dXYijSuJfr6bzRIR88qLuEfa+xj4XiQAaBRGMjxJQhApzIVs4hls49y\n1VZu+/qeO98TXAO3jJj2abq7HZeTnu0wOG14HAwusZwIbOkr1cT3m53P1smAStxZ\nC7AJk2A2Rg77pPeA3dTpwnF6VOTReSuhrPvc71xlV7mo7kkkbKjycSNuQpOw1ucA\nN51h1eINrsWOqVGRHiLPN7UUvSmhtEanrsw/h46Qne/kg9Znk8zhzPHKGmcNBEk7\n3OlM5oqGq2iJdCNNYkzM6ej5lDivK0Wp8YddmD1WvwpLH9nghJw=\n=PPn6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-19T12:08:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10145666?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngoyal16