on, ''auto'' mode, and mobile fallback\n- Closes #11","tree":{"sha":"d100877c1e859dc4f24b37db481da34949b9d3ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divmora/show-and-tell/git/trees/d100877c1e859dc4f24b37db481da34949b9d3ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divmora/show-and-tell/git/commits/30eed60835d60df5e6e47d27692f572012b51d26","verification":{"payload":"tree d100877c1e859dc4f24b37db481da34949b9d3ed\nparent 601e9a84fb1229ab7f4bd6214cdfc1d1c89dbd76\nauthor Nitin Goyal <nitingoyal.dev@gmail.com> 1789630768 +0530\ncommitter Nitin Goyal <nitingoyal.dev@gmail.com> 1789630768 +0530\n\nfix(sdk): add mobile getDisplayMedia capability detection and DOM fallback (#11)\n\n- Add isSupported, isScreenCaptureSupported, isDomRecordingSupported, getSupportedModes, and isMobile capability helpers to ShowAndTell and RecorderEngine\n- Add ''auto'' mode option and fallbackToDom configuration to ShowAndTellConfig\n- Automatically select DOM session replay on devices lacking getDisplayMedia (iPhone Chrome/Safari, mobile browsers)\n- Improve error message when pixel mode is explicitly requested on unsupported devices to recommend DOM mode\n- Update demo playground to default to ''auto'' mode with mobile device detection notice\n- Add unit tests for capability detection, ''auto'' mode, and mobile fallback\n- Closes #11\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCAAdFiEETlZhMiBUcj2k7+IFqFZ9oFfmbyEFAmqrmTAACgkQqFZ9oFfm\nbyFmVBAAgUcfjtET1kRFex5Sz8S/juzWxS1hcp24N7bT+ZfzwflefFuDNqFR3R7I\nNRhni6uX10XGOGiwZGIWxA7nYEdeDr3+XPJ2UdH+md02Uhd71K6eAmJPPYKUcRxN\nb7HsSIM/OeFebi5DRfh6NLAjS8BcgkqGyhcWf67nZm5v9hF8i374KfbUUGGT+A6G\nMXlX8KiExGWl10liILebJUsCR4w4fyL39WyyaFL8xOQ2+utVI2ddhvGMWSlO4EXr\nhzJ5E3YPoR7N5VKj88jzgAsbrQZok+YgcHeCK3iSNguyAUE6H3ndUqbelMPeJRoX\n1j3rL8gyj2g/VxUza3WJsvfsHGrx7kgVHekOGsS9khm+Uivf+sloB7gRq8T+SijW\nB2A9WqfLwm3JT6L4bDPd51Q6nO9wwctVTM9Yvn45gEfz3aajTSfOyDyRHY2lz5Ui\nomdysfJcqhb7IyoJwoYdXx5/LkXLbbntGPy2AGTRsuDz+sXTdn3tWKYIzjs7PYi6\nBLw+wz3CVkjumqN0I0u