 11 unit tests covering progress, PUT, multipart POST, error branches, and abort signals\n- Update ROADMAP.md","tree":{"sha":"93be900521b51339c3cc3b2dc736efa85c563b95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divmora/show-and-tell/git/trees/93be900521b51339c3cc3b2dc736efa85c563b95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divmora/show-and-tell/git/commits/601e9a84fb1229ab7f4bd6214cdfc1d1c89dbd76","verification":{"payload":"tree 93be900521b51339c3cc3b2dc736efa85c563b95\nparent 8e2c3b872850aaef4ed0d4400edfd0a5cd2e35c8\nauthor Nitin Goyal <nitingoyal.dev@gmail.com> 1789628738 +0530\ncommitter Nitin Goyal <nitingoyal.dev@gmail.com> 1789628738 +0530\n\nfeat(storage): add direct S3, R2, and Supabase presigned URL uploads with real-time progress\n\n- Add PresignedUrlTarget, PresignedUploadContext, PresignedUploadConfig, and UploadConfig interfaces\n- Implement uploadBlobToPresignedTarget with XHR upload byte-progress tracking and XML error parsing\n- Support direct HTTP PUT and S3 presigned POST multipart policies\n- Implement uploadRecordingAssets for multi-asset coordinated uploads (screen + PiP camera bubble)\n- Integrate uploadPresigned method onto RecordingResult for active sessions and reload-recovered results\n- Add animated progress bar, percentage indicator, share link, and error retry state in PreviewModal Shadow DOM\n- Add mock presigned ticket generation and direct streaming PUT/POST endpoints in companion server\n- Add cloud upload options and dynamic code snippet generation in demo playground\n- Add 11 unit tests covering progress, PUT, multipart POST, error branches, and abort signals\n- Update ROADMAP.md\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCAAdFiEETlZhMiBUcj2k7+IFqFZ9oFfmbyEFAmqrkUIACgkQqFZ9oFfm\nbyHjMA//SDziSA71lZteun2LYizlN//MfciJ64zB7foADBL2uI7ItpPWr5Yul4m3\neojtqniZUqsVJ6xGb9Mx+c6wBFhS+nBXdin9UmiM64IYI1W3OeoYTBHYlOTYI6cP\nn991kJYhIPYTuG4qA1aUc7aTOsaPeVx1ZIiFzAFyWgG6+TTWB97YwCVcuvD+ZanL\n1eXL7Yi297TSYFxDZIUaSCyDTx6L7GJFNSmuaz