PipController) for OS-level always-on-top webcam & controls across windows, apps, and tabs\n- Support 16:9 Google Meet style widescreen landscape and circular webcam shapes\n- Fix dual PiP bubble in screen recordings via direct DOM stream capture and smart compositing for window/tab surfaces\n- Auto-resume video playback and prevent canvas hangs when switching tabs or display surfaces\n- Add opt-in synchronized webcam recording and frame-accurate replay to DOM session replay mode\n- Fix DOM mode select dropdown value restoration and text selection capture/replay\n- Replace native browser video controls with unified custom video player and fix Infinity:NaN:NaN duration display\n- Add real-time ready-to-use JavaScript embed code generator and 1-click clipboard copy to demo playground","tree":{"sha":"de14917d04324e157d7ab034878f413ea2e1203f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divmora/show-and-tell/git/trees/de14917d04324e157d7ab034878f413ea2e1203f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divmora/show-and-tell/git/commits/5b8f5f526bf9a5584333ab338c6b8e2d892c5c77","verification":{"payload":"tree de14917d04324e157d7ab034878f413ea2e1203f\nparent c0aced7fd5fbd314eae4fe1843851aa9297a1c1e\nauthor Nitin Goyal <nitingoyal.dev@gmail.com> 1788720612 +0530\ncommitter Nitin Goyal <nitingoyal.dev@gmail.com> 1788720612 +0530\n\nfeat(sdk): add 16:9 Google Meet PiP webcam, Document PiP controls, and live embed generator\n\n- Add Document Picture-in-Picture controller (PipController) for OS-level always-on-top webcam & controls across windows, apps, and tabs\n- Support 16:9 Google Meet style widescreen landscape and circular webcam shapes\n- Fix dual PiP bubble in screen recordings via direct DOM stream capture and smart compositing for window/tab surfaces\n- Auto-resume video playback and prevent canvas hangs when switching tabs or display surfaces\n- Add opt-in synchronized webcam recording and frame-accurate replay to DOM session replay mode\n- Fix DOM mode select dropdown value restor