"email":"nitingoyal.dev@gmail.com","name":"Nitin Goyal"},"message":"feat(sdk): add DOM session recording, fine-grained PII masking, and zoom player controls\n\n- Support dual recording modes: pixel (default) and dom (zero-permission session replay)\n- Capture exact browser view dimensions with automatic initial and dynamic scroll restoration\n- Implement fine-grained multilevel scoped PII masking for text-type inputs and rendered DOM text\n- Add Zoom modes (fit, 100%, 150%), grab-to-pan, smooth cursor auto-follow, and modal maximize\n- Fix standalone HTML replay layout, header collision, and non-clipping flexbox overflow\n- Update interactive demo playground and comprehensive privacy and zoom documentation","tree":{"sha":"8306191cbf20227912319df66c4db37ce21f301b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divmora/show-and-tell/git/trees/8306191cbf20227912319df66c4db37ce21f301b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divmora/show-and-tell/git/commits/c0aced7fd5fbd314eae4fe1843851aa9297a1c1e","verification":{"payload":"tree 8306191cbf20227912319df66c4db37ce21f301b\nparent 8241bcebf18332c02627b9afdba6fb5fe0ba3965\nauthor Nitin Goyal <nitingoyal.dev@gmail.com> 1788713820 +0530\ncommitter Nitin Goyal <nitingoyal.dev@gmail.com> 1788713820 +0530\n\nfeat(sdk): add DOM session recording, fine-grained PII masking, and zoom player controls\n\n- Support dual recording modes: pixel (default) and dom (zero-permission session replay)\n- Capture exact browser view dimensions with automatic initial and dynamic scroll restoration\n- Implement fine-grained multilevel scoped PII masking for text-type inputs and rendered DOM text\n- Add Zoom modes (fit, 100%, 150%), grab-to-pan, smooth cursor auto-follow, and modal maximize\n- Fix standalone HTML replay layout, header collision, and non-clipping flexbox overflow\n- Update interactive demo playground and comprehensive privacy and zoom documentation\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCAAdFiEETlZhMiBUcj2k7+IFq