:{"date":"2026-09-27T14:56:29Z","email":"github@emergent.sh","name":"emergent-agent-e1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T14:56:29Z","email":"github@emergent.sh","name":"emergent-agent-e1"},"message":"US-088: re-arm a delivered calendar reminder when its event is rescheduled\n\nreminderDeliveredAt is the idempotency marker of one schedule, but nothing\ncleared it when the event moved, so a rescheduled event was never reminded\nagain. A calendarEvent update listener now clears the marker (conditionally,\nsystem context) when startsAt moves to another instant or reminderMinutes\nchanges; the dispatch claim itself and unrelated edits never re-arm.","tree":{"sha":"bb51adc31209a093a2647f2cb25b44a1c0398cf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maxx-abrt/A2E-Suite/git/trees/bb51adc31209a093a2647f2cb25b44a1c0398cf9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maxx-abrt/A2E-Suite/git/commits/12d6f314f2e2fbd4a37b9a5a0fe2d3dc3ca416bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222461215?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/emergent-agent-e1","id":222461215,"login":"emergent-agent-e1","node_id":"U_kgDODUJ9Hw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/subscripti