:0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T14:55:51Z","email":"github@emergent.sh","name":"emergent-agent-e1"},"message":"US-087: run bundled app provisioning on the migrating server only, never on workers\n\nThe worker shares the image entrypoint; no shipped worker disabled bundled\nprovisioning, so podman (no start ordering) and every compose worker restart\nre-ran app:provision-bundled + install-pre-installed-apps concurrently with the\nserver. The documented DISABLE_BUNDLED_APP_PROVISIONING opt-out was also never\npassed to the server container.\n\n- entrypoint.sh: skip provisioning when DISABLE_DB_MIGRATIONS=true unless\n  DISABLE_BUNDLED_APP_PROVISIONING=false forces it\n- workers (compose, coolify x2, podman-compose, manual podman) set it true;\n  servers pass it through\n- provision-bundled-apps.deployment.spec.ts runs the real entrypoint with\n  stubbed yarn/psql and guards the manifests (10 failing at base, 15/15)","tree":{"sha":"f8b1a373d7bf1af847171b8cc239bb5aa0c93c24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maxx-abrt/A2E-Suite/git/trees/f8b1a373d7bf1af847171b8cc239bb5aa0c93c24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maxx-abrt/A2E-Suite/git/commits/936a8c3c2e03c3ad836a2e573325321882988aa4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222461215?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/emergent-agent-e1","id":222461215,"login":"emergent-agent-e1","node_id":"U_kgDODUJ9Hw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/receive