tions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maxx-abrt/A2E-Suite/commits/cac0d534be5107aac58900d1869d17e83706a80c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:14:53Z","email":"github@emergent.sh","name":"emergent-agent-e1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:14:53Z","email":"github@emergent.sh","name":"emergent-agent-e1"},"message":"## Session Complete — US-076 + US-077 + US-078/079 Implemented (9 commits, all pushed)\n\n### What was done\n\n**US-076** — Fix INSTALL_APP idempotency (already-installed apps no longer fail with APP_ALREADY_INSTALLED on retry; blocks M2 exit criteria c/d). 2 regression specs.\n\n**US-077** — A2E allowlist + OnboardingInstallableApps expansion\n- `A2eSuiteApplicationUniversalIdentifiers.ts` and `OnboardingInstallableApps.ts`: added Projects (`4f759655`), Chat (`e2dce399`), Drive (`b11cd01f`)\n- All 5 A2E apps now appear in Settings → Applications → A2E Suite and the onboarding install-apps step once registered\n\n**US-078 + US-079** — M1 one-command Docker provisioning (closes G1 gap)\n- **Dockerfile**: new `twenty-apps-build` multi-stage runs `corepack enable yarn + yarn install + yarn twenty dev:build --tarball` for all 5 apps; tarballs copied to `/app/packages/twenty-apps/dist` in the production image\n- **`ApplicationRegistrationSourceType.BUNDLED`**: new enum value for filesystem-resident tarballs\n- **`ApplicationRegistrationEntity.bundledAppSourcePath`**: nullable text column + `@WasIntroducedInUpgrade`\n- **2-39 instance migration** (`1789905000000`): `ADD COLUMN bundledAppSourcePath TEXT` — registered in both `V2_39_UpgradeVersionCommandModule` and `INSTANCE_COMMANDS`\n- **`ApplicationPackageFetcherService`**: BUNDLED case reads tarball from FS path (no file-storage upload)\n- **`ProvisionBundledAppsCommand`** (`app:provision-bundled`): registers bundled tarballs with `isPreInstalled=true, ownerWorkspaceId=null`; idempotent; `--dry-run`; graceful absent-dir skip for non-Docker\n- **`entrypoint.sh`**: `provision_bundled_apps()` runs after upgrade (provision-bundled + install-pre-installed-apps backfill); `DISABLE_BUNDLED_APP_PROVISIONING=true` opt-out\n- **`PreInstalledAppsService`**: APP_ALREADY_INSTALLED no longer error-logs (idempotent boot)\n- **5-case unit spec** for `ProvisionBundledAppsCommand`\n- **Docs**: DEPLOY.md, docker-compose.coolify.yml, docs/applications.md updated\n\n**Tier-2 residuals** (need orchestrator + Docker): live Docker build with 5 tarballs; `app:provision-bundled` registers on fresh server → Settings shows A2E Suite section with all 5 apps.\n\n- **Next Action Items:**\n  - **Orchestrator M1 Docker Proof**: Build the image and run `docker compose up` on clean volume to verify Settings → Applications shows all 5 A2E apps without manual CLI\n  - **Orchestrator M2 Live Seeding**: Run STUDENT preset apply and verify seeded rows > 0 for Documents; then confirm US-076 retry behavior live\n  - **D-B1 Bureau Decision**: Make the Documents+Projects bundle packaging call so TEAM/INDIVIDUAL presets can add Projects — unlocks the rest of M2 + M2(a)\n  - **P4C.3 Browser Proof**: Run `/calendar` scope-dialog journeys to tick P4C.3 and unblock P4C.4 (occurrence expansion in view — Tier-0 front work once unblocked)\n\nEmergent-Commit-Key: 42f5e0afa8ecfac524abda7379197bcd4a4bc9600e4349baa37d3750308f2476","tree":{"sha":"2f391e705b7319f55f5c64916c890ed6172f357d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maxx-abrt/A2E-Suite/git/trees/2f391e705b7319f55f5c64916c890ed6172f357d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maxx-abrt/A2E-Suite/git/commits/cac0d534be5107aac58900d1869d17e83706a80c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222461215?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"h