https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maxx-abrt/A2E-Suite/commits/5bfe5befc4c3aa691bd98f585baedc8fa644a0c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:01:25Z","email":"github@emergent.sh","name":"emergent-agent-e1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:01:25Z","email":"github@emergent.sh","name":"emergent-agent-e1"},"message":"US-077/US-078/US-079: M1 bundled provisioning + A2E allowlist/installable-apps expansion\n\nUS-077: Add a2e-projects / a2e-chat / a2e-drive to A2E allowlist and\nOnboardingInstallableApps so they appear in Settings → Applications → A2E\nSuite and in the onboarding install-apps step once registered on the server.\n\nUS-078 + US-079: M1 one-command provisioning — bake all 5 A2E apps into the\nDocker image and register them automatically at startup.\n\n- Dockerfile: new twenty-apps-build stage runs yarn install + dev:build\n  --tarball for each app; collects tarballs under /app/packages/twenty-apps/dist\n- entrypoint.sh: adds provision_bundled_apps() step (after upgrade, before\n  cron registration); opt-out via DISABLE_BUNDLED_APP_PROVISIONING=true\n- ApplicationRegistrationSourceType: new BUNDLED enum value\n- ApplicationRegistrationEntity: nullable bundledAppSourcePath text column\n- 2-39 instance command (1789905000000): ADD COLUMN bundledAppSourcePath\n- ApplicationPackageFetcherService: BUNDLED case reads tarball from FS path\n- ProvisionBundledAppsCommand (app:provision-bundled): reads *.tgz from\n  BUNDLED_APPS_DIR (default /app/packages/twenty-apps/dist), creates/updates\n  registrations with sourceType=BUNDLED, isPreInstalled=true, ownerWorkspaceId=null;\n  idempotent (skips same version); --dry-run flag; graceful absent-dir skip\n  for non-Docker servers\n- DatabaseCommandModule: wires ProvisionBundledAppsCommand + adds\n  ApplicationRegistrationEntity to TypeOrmModule.forFeature\n- docs/applications.md: corrected allowlist table + troubleshooting entries","tree":{"sha":"9f6258156ef832f87b49124d10976e49a55b054d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maxx-abrt/A2E-Suite/git/trees/9f6258156ef832f87b49124d10976e49a55b054d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maxx-abrt/A2E-Suite/git/commits/5bfe5befc4c3aa691bd98f585baedc8fa644a0c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222461215?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/emergent-agent-e1","id":222461215,"login":"emergent-agent-e1","node_id":"U_kgDODUJ9Hw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maxx-abrt/A2E-Suite/commit/5bfe5befc4c3aa691bd98f585baedc8fa644a0c4","node_id":"C_kwDOUQM--toAKDViZmU1YmVmYzRjM2FhNjkxYmQ5OGY1ODViYWVkYzhmYTY0NGEwYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/maxx-abrt/A2E-Suite/commit/79a3248a87669e6ef981c416910da30739909ff3","sha":"79a3248a87669e6ef981c416910da30739909ff3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maxx-abrt/A2E-Suite/commits/79a3248a87669e6ef981c416910da30739909ff3"}],"sha":"5bfe5befc4c3aa691bd98f585baedc8fa644a0c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maxx-abrt/A2E-Suite/commits/5bfe5befc4c3aa691bd98f585baedc8fa644a0c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222461215?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/emergent-agent-e1","id":222461215,"login":"emergent-agent-e1","node_id":"U_kgDODUJ9Hw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maxx-abrt/A2E-Suite/commits/79a3248a87669e6ef981c416910da30739909ff3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T19:37:49Z","email":"github@emergent.sh","name":"emergent-agent-e1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T19:37:49Z","email":"github@emergent.sh","name":"emergent-agent-e1"},"message":"## Session Complete — US-076 Implemented & Committed\n\n**Tasks completed:** 1 (US-076). Deferred: 0. Queue exhausted.\n\n### What was done\n- **Read and fully reconciled** PLAN.md (M0–M6 milestones), tasks/prd.json, all phase reports, and deferred-batch9.md\n- **US-074** ✅ and **US-075** ✅ were already done in prior sessions (commits `abed30a3` + `50a931ca` + provenance follow-up, verified live `59a5ce7b`)\n- **Identified US-076** — the new defect recorded by the orchestrator in phase-01-report 20:15 CEST (2026-09-22): `applyWorkspaceTemplateOperation`''s INSTALL_APP step called `installApplication` unconditionally even when the app was already installed, causing `APP_ALREADY_INSTALLED`/`SAME_VERSION` → FAILED step → `appliedTemplateKeyVersion: null` — blocking M2 exit criteria (c)/(d) and honest retry completion\n- **Implemented the fix** in `workspace-template.service.ts` `installTemplateApplication`: after version-compatibility check, call `applicationService.findByUniversalIdentifier`; if app already installed → log + return `succeeded` without calling `installApplication` (mirrors what the preview already computed as `currentlyInstalled: true`)\n- **Added 2 regression tests** in `workspace-template.service.spec.ts`: (a) already-installed idempotent apply → step succeeded, no install call; (b) retry of failed step when app was installed between retries → step succeeded, no install call. All existing tests preserved (default mock returns `null` → install IS called)\n- **Committed** `US-076: Fix INSTALL_APP idempotency — skip succeeded when app already installed at compatible version` + pushed to `main`\n- **Created deferred-batch10.md** documenting the exhausted executor queue\n\n### Patterns noted for `.ralph-tui/progress.md`\n- The `applicationService.findByUniversalIdentifier({ universalIdentifier, workspaceId })` pattern already existed in the preview path (lines 657-662) — any future idempotency check in the install flow should reuse this same call rather than catching `APP_ALREADY_INSTALLED` from `installApplication`\n- The `findByUniversalIdentifier` mock pattern (`jest.fn().mockResolvedValue(null)`) is already present in all 3 companion onboarding spec files (main, idempotency, partial-failure) — new tests that need \"app already installed\" use `mockResolvedValueOnce` for isolation\n\n### Tier-2 residuals (orchestrator''s next pass)\n- Live STUDENT-apply on a workspace with A2E Documents 0.2.0 already installed → INSTALL_APP step reports `succeeded`, `appliedTemplateKeyVersion` set\n- P4.1 human-ID concurrency proof (a2e-projects now installable via US-074)\n- a2e-chat install chain (unblocked at code level)\n- P1.3/P1.6c browser journey (nav-restore cycle closed by US-075)\n\n- **Next Action Items:**\n  - **Orchestrator Tier-2 Pass**: Run live STUDENT→apply on installed-Documents workspace to verify US-076 live, tick M2 retry-completion, and record any new defects for the executor queue\n  - **P4C.3 Browser Proof**: Run `/calendar` scope-dialog this-vs-series journey on live stack to tick P4C.3 and unlock P4C.4 (reminders/team)\n  - **P1.6c Authentication Codegen**: Run `graphql:generate` against authenticated schema on live stack and run the onboarding Settings browser journey to tick P1.6c (unlocks P1.6e/P1.7a/P1.7b)\n  - **P7.0 Gate Proofs**: Run ledger replay / numbering race / rounding / period-close / iban-denial live proofs to unfreeze all 21 P7 bullets\n\nEmergent-Commit-Key: e927d2a9ace4f319e427bda41d439152bae30da24fb886a1c35da59136f8ad80","tree":{"sha":"96596904073f262ec38b00425e283409504761db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maxx-abrt/A2E-Suite/git/trees/96596904073f262ec38b00425e283409504761db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maxx-abrt/A2E-Suite/git/commits/79a3248a87669e6ef981c416910da30739909ff3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222461215?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emergent-agent-e1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.co