/ashikMostofaTonmoy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashikMostofaTonmoy","id":43008495,"login":"ashikMostofaTonmoy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMDA4NDk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ashikMostofaTonmoy/three-tier-deployment/commit/ecd18b9547cea96666c7245a10f023bea8013f96","node_id":"C_kwDOUQShfNoAKGVjZDE4Yjk1NDdjZWE5NjY2NmM3MjQ1YTEwZjAyM2JlYTgwMTNmOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ashikMostofaTonmoy/three-tier-deployment/commit/8a8e9e532d96fed947068a1cd6851ec983ed0e00","sha":"8a8e9e532d96fed947068a1cd6851ec983ed0e00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashikMostofaTonmoy/three-tier-deployment/commits/8a8e9e532d96fed947068a1cd6851ec983ed0e00"}],"sha":"ecd18b9547cea96666c7245a10f023bea8013f96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashikMostofaTonmoy/three-tier-deployment/commits/ecd18b9547cea96666c7245a10f023bea8013f96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43008495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashikMostofaTonmoy","id":43008495,"login":"ashikMostofaTonmoy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMDA4NDk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashikMostofaTonmoy/three-tier-deployment/commits/8a8e9e532d96fed947068a1cd6851ec983ed0e00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:27:44Z","email":"tonmoy.ashik@gmail.com","name":"ashikMostofaTonmoy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:27:44Z","email":"tonmoy.ashik@gmail.com","name":"ashikMostofaTonmoy"},"message":"Part 2: full three-tier stack on one VM — backend, database, two automation paths\n\n- backend/: Express service (Tier 2). Calls Open-Meteo server-side, logs each\n  query to Postgres, serves /api/v1/forecast and /api/v1/history. PM2 cluster\n  mode (ecosystem.config.cjs) so deploys use `pm2 startOrReload` (rolling,\n  zero-downtime) instead of a hard restart.\n- database/migrations/001_create_search_history.sql: Tier 3 schema.\n- frontend/: unchanged app, +getHistory()/city param (api.js) and a resilient\n  RecentSearches panel that hides itself if the endpoint isn''t there — same\n  code works against Part 1 (Open-Meteo direct) and Part 2 (real backend).\n- nginx/three-tier-full.conf: Part 2 variant, /api/ -> 127.0.0.1:3000.\n- infra/01-ec2.sh: add --instance-type (Part 2 uses t3.small).\n- infra/21-self-hosted-runner.sh: installs+registers a GitHub Actions runner\n  on the same instance via SSM (one-time, outside any pipeline).\n- infra/teardown.sh: also deregisters the self-hosted runner.\n- scripts/deploy-db.sh, scripts/deploy-backend.sh: idempotent, real error\n  checking on migrations (no swallowed failures).\n- .github/workflows/full-stack-oidc-ssm.yml: Option A — GitHub-hosted runner,\n  OIDC + SSM, zero AWS keys stored. Includes a live zero-downtime check\n  (curl loop against /api/v1/history during the deploy).\n- .github/workflows/full-stack-self-hosted.yml: Option B — a self-hosted\n  runner living on the same VM; no OIDC/AWS credentials in the deploy steps\n  at all. Same zero-downtime check.","tree":{"sha":"873bdc63f514694d32a7c64033b224d8c7e59dea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashikMostofaTonmoy/three-tier-deployment/git/trees/873bdc63f514694d32a7c64033b224d8c7e59dea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ashikMostofaTonmoy/three-tier-deployment/git/commits/8a8e9e532d96fed947068a1cd6851ec983ed0e00","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43008495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashikMostofaTonmoy","id":43008495,"login":"ashikMostofaTonmoy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMDA4NDk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashikMostofaTonmoy/