ttps://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/bff7961f5c5dc924216ab48f5e7715702b2cb6f9","sha":"bff7961f5c5dc924216ab48f5e7715702b2cb6f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/bff7961f5c5dc924216ab48f5e7715702b2cb6f9"}],"sha":"d018f89ae53a6538f5fb9f11f0ba09c4c729678c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/d018f89ae53a6538f5fb9f11f0ba09c4c729678c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/bff7961f5c5dc924216ab48f5e7715702b2cb6f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T23:44:59Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T23:44:59Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"jitsi: the token''s sub is the server, not the app id\n\nProsody rebuilds the room''s address out of `sub` (`token/util.lib.lua`,\n`verify_room`): `conference.<sub>`. With `sub = \"pediatric\"` it looks for\n`pediatric-<id>@conference.pediatric` while the room lives in\n`conference.pediatric-meet.daguito.com`, so EVERY joiner is refused —\ndoctor and patient alike — and the browser only says \"no tienes permiso\npara unirte a esta llamada\", naming neither the claim nor the room.\n\nThe legacy''s `security/jitsi.go` gets away with the app id because\n`enable_domain_verification` is off on its server; a freshly installed\n`jitsi-meet-tokens` defaults it to true.\n\nMeasured on the client''s box: prosody logs `Room and token mismatched`\nfor every join since the box went up.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013TfwtYEpkgdfp4PdS6YxB9","tree":{"sha":"8d9557aec6d7151e1f3d1a5296da916e2324a1f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/8d9557aec6d7151e1f3d1a5296da916e2324a1f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/bff7961f5c5dc924216ab48f5e7715702b2cb6f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/bff7961f5c5dc924216ab48f5e7715702b2cb6f9","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKGJmZjc5NjFmNWM1ZGM5MjQyMTZhYjQ4ZjVlNzcxNTcwMmIyY2I2Zjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/df59066b589759a7b26dc67f39ac49e2352aad02","sha":"df59066b589759a7b26dc67f39ac49e2352aad02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/df59066b589759a7b26dc67f39ac49e2352aad02"}],"sha":"bff7961f5c5dc924216ab48f5e7715702b2cb6f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/bff7961f5c5dc924216ab48f5e7715702b2cb6f9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/df59066b589759a7b26dc67f39ac49e2352aad02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T16:02:52Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T16:02:52Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"jitsi: open the TURN ports, or the media has nowhere to go\n\nThe security group opened 443 and UDP/10000 and stopped there, which\nworks right up until it does not: a network that blocks outbound UDP to\nhigh ports leaves the room looking perfect — it opens, the token\nverifies, the participant list fills in — with not one packet of audio\nor video moving. Hospital wifi, corporate laptops and some mobile\ncarriers all do exactly that, and there was no fallback because the only\nother way in was shut.\n\nNot a guess about which ports: prosody''s external_services hands the\nbrowser these three by name, and every one has to be reachable or the\nbrowser is being pointed at a door that is bricked up.\n\n  stun:  <domain>:3478                  udp\n  turn:  <domain>:3478?transport=udp\n  turns: <domain>:5349?transport=tcp    the one that saves hard networks\n\ncoturn is built with no-tcp, so 3478/tcp is not worth opening.\n\nMeasured after the apply: 5349 completes a TLS handshake with the Let''s\nEncrypt cert, and 3478 answers a STUN binding request.","tree":{"sha":"c95cdbe9c19bceefdfe6d3129fc3b62987ff3385","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/c95cdbe9c19bceefdfe6d3129fc3b62987ff3385"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/df59066b589759a7b26dc67f39ac49e2352aad02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/df59066b589759a7b26dc67f39ac49e2352aad02","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKGRmNTkwNjZiNTg5NzU5YTdiMjZkYzY3ZjM5YWM0OWUyMzUyYWFkMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/354db7a3b8eee30693eb744c9aa853ed816d8dcd","sha":"354db7a3b8eee30693eb744c9aa853ed816d8dcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/354db7a3b8eee30693eb744c9aa853ed816d8dcd"}],"sha":"df59066b589759a7b26dc67f39ac49e2352aad02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/df59066b589759a7b26dc67f39ac49e2352aad02"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/354db7a3b8eee30693eb744c9aa853ed816d8dcd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T16:02:52Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T16:02:52Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"jitsi: let the API point somewhere else without tearing the box down\n\njitsi_domain fed two things at once — the hostname of our own box and the\nenv the API serves — so \"keep the server, send the consultations to the\nlegacy one meanwhile\" was not expressible: writing meet.midulabs.com in\nthere tries to create that record in Daguito''s zone, and the module''s\nown precondition (rightly) refuses.\n\njitsi_api_domain splits them. The box, its DNS and its certificate stay\nup; only the API''s env moves, and going back is deleting one line. The\nroom credentials are NOT injected while it points elsewhere: they belong\nto our prosody and mean nothing to somebody else''s server, and a half\nconfiguration is exactly what lib/jitsi.ts declines to sign with.","tree":{"sha":"7ca099e59d4a678092fd73f693d0d5ea5426dfc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/7ca099e59d4a678092fd73f693d0d5ea5426dfc8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/354db7a3b8eee30693eb744c9aa853ed816d8dcd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/354db7a3b8eee30693eb744c9aa853ed816d8dcd","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKDM1NGRiN2EzYjhlZWUzMDY5M2ViNzQ0YzlhYTg1M2VkODE2ZDhkY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/0b4174c29a2ec22d6154f04005583351a2d1f2b1","sha":"0b4174c29a2ec22d6154f04005583351a2d1f2b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/0b4174c29a2ec22d6154f04005583351a2d1f2b1"}],"sha":"354db7a3b8eee30693eb744c9aa853ed816d8dcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/354db7a3b8eee30693eb744c9aa853ed816d8dcd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/0b4174c29a2ec22d6154f04005583351a2d1f2b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T00:07:55Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T00:07:55Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"jitsi: sign the room token with a typ header\n\nluajwtjitsi refuses a token whose header has no `typ` (\"Invalid typ\")\nbefore it looks at a single claim, and jose does not add one unless it\nis asked to. The failure is silent in the worst way: prosody accepts the\nconnection, finds no SASL result and closes it, so the doctor sees a\nreconnect loop and nothing anywhere says \"token\".\n\nIt never showed until now because it never ran: with no JITSI_APP_SECRET\n`isJitsiSecured()` was false and the signer returned null. The first\nconsultation on the client''s own server is the first token this repo\never signed.\n\nThe test asserts the HEADER now, not only the claims.","tree":{"sha":"18ec9d7cbc66ed798dc40edff98c0c0652ce3290","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/18ec9d7cbc66ed798dc40edff98c0c0652ce3290"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/0b4174c29a2ec22d6154f04005583351a2d1f2b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/0b4174c29a2ec22d6154f04005583351a2d1f2b1","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKDBiNDE3NGMyOWEyZWMyMmQ2MTU0ZjA0MDA1NTgzMzUxYTJkMWYyYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/70e640afcd408bae627a9cae41b39064e745605a","sha":"70e640afcd408bae627a9cae41b39064e745605a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/70e640afcd408bae627a9cae41b39064e745605a"}],"sha":"0b4174c29a2ec22d6154f04005583351a2d1f2b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/0b4174c29a2ec22d6154f04005583351a2d1f2b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/70e640afcd408bae627a9cae41b39064e745605a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T00:07:55Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T00:07:55Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"jitsi: the client''s own server instead of the legacy one\n\nAn EC2 t4g.small with an Elastic IP in Daguito''s public subnets, a Let''s\nEncrypt certificate and the JWT module on. It is the only piece of this\nmicro with an inbound security group and a public IP, and it cannot be\notherwise: the media is UDP/10000 and a Cloudflare Tunnel carries TCP.\nIt is also the only piece that moves the bill — COST.md has the numbers.\n\nTurning it on also closes the rooms. Until now JITSI_APP_SECRET was\nempty, the API signed no token and the room name WAS the key; the box\ngets jitsi-meet-tokens and a generated secret out of SSM, so the API\nsigns and prosody verifies.\n\nThe box is stateless: user_data is what it knows, and a broken one is\nreplaced rather than repaired. Three things in there that the Jitsi\nquick-install does not do, each one learned by watching it fail:\n\n- the NAT harvester, without which ice4j offers only the private address\n  and the room connects and then carries no media at all;\n- the wait for the Elastic IP and its DNS before asking Let''s Encrypt,\n  because asking early burns one of five weekly attempts and leaves the\n  self-signed certificate in place;\n- `inspect` copied into Lua 5.4, because Ubuntu 24.04 packages it for\n  5.1/5.2/5.3 only and prosody 0.12 runs on 5.4. The module then fails\n  to load, `authentication = \"token\"` is left with no SASL mechanism,\n  and every joiner is accepted and dropped — which the browser shows as\n  \"Ha sido desconectado. Reconectando en 5 segundos\", on a loop, looking\n  exactly like a network problem.\n\nThe AWS CLI comes from Amazon''s installer, since noble has no `awscli`\ndeb at all and `apt-get install awscli` ends the boot under `set -e`.","tree":{"sha":"773f98b2fd74a153c0aa0a2a3c5a0bc6fc593ceb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/773f98b2fd74a153c0aa0a2a3c5a0bc6fc593ceb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/70e640afcd408bae627a9cae41b39064e745605a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/70e640afcd408bae627a9cae41b39064e745605a","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKDcwZTY0MGFmY2Q0MDhiYWU2MjdhOWNhZTQxYjM5MDY0ZTc0NTYwNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/277d5a53381416a54b65db2e057dd860bdb198b7","sha":"277d5a53381416a54b65db2e057dd860bdb198b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/277d5a53381416a54b65db2e057dd860bdb198b7"}],"sha":"70e640afcd408bae627a9cae41b39064e745605a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/70e640afcd408bae627a9cae41b39064e745605a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/277d5a53381416a54b65db2e057dd860bdb198b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T15:07:05Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T15:07:05Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"scripts: the panel has a manual deploy too\n\nThe API has had `scripts/deploy.sh` since the beginning for the day CI is not\nan option — this clone, for one, has no remote. The panel had nothing, and its\ndeploy is not \"upload a file\": the content types, the 60s Cache-Control and\nthe second key the patient''s page is published under each fail quietly when\ntyped from memory. A page served as application/octet-stream downloads instead\nof opening; a missing `consulta` key is a link that 404s in a parent''s hand.\n\nSame steps as deploy-panel.yml, plus the ordering written down: the page goes\nup before the bundle, and both before an API that links to them.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JmY3Fk4DG3JGZHnmxYoavs","tree":{"sha":"166c0bdf10cf7cf82b893593c60ce5819353124b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/166c0bdf10cf7cf82b893593c60ce5819353124b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/277d5a53381416a54b65db2e057dd860bdb198b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12"