/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/88f058738f9aaf05097d6f8ff41da2303eb2c72a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T02:32:08Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T02:32:08Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"panel 0.2.4\n\nThe patient''s page (screen + `consulta` route), the markdown editor toolbar\nand the consultation screen that no longer reloads on start.\n\nThis one goes out FIRST: it is what publishes the `consulta` key the API''s\nlinks point at. An API rolled ahead of it mints links that 404 until this\ndeploy lands.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JmY3Fk4DG3JGZHnmxYoavs","tree":{"sha":"e61b41dc4db807a4f47f21137b097c3a0e6dd0f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/e61b41dc4db807a4f47f21137b097c3a0e6dd0f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/88f058738f9aaf05097d6f8ff41da2303eb2c72a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/88f058738f9aaf05097d6f8ff41da2303eb2c72a","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKDg4ZjA1ODczOGY5YWFmMDUwOTdkNmY4ZmY0MWRhMjMwM2ViMmM3MmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/db44d5f854e99fe2b7f5bbb83e7ac9f033f848c6","sha":"db44d5f854e99fe2b7f5bbb83e7ac9f033f848c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/db44d5f854e99fe2b7f5bbb83e7ac9f033f848c6"}],"sha":"88f058738f9aaf05097d6f8ff41da2303eb2c72a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/88f058738f9aaf05097d6f8ff41da2303eb2c72a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/db44d5f854e99fe2b7f5bbb83e7ac9f033f848c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T02:32:03Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T02:32:03Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"patient: the link is a route, and it can live under Daguito''s domain\n\nTwo things a parent sees in the link the practice sends over WhatsApp: a\nbucket hostname they have never heard of, and `.html`, which reads like\nsomething that leaked out of a server.\n\nThe page is now published under a second, extensionless key (`consulta`, same\nbytes, `Content-Type: text/html`) and that is what the API links to.\n`patient.html` stays published: links already minted live 12 h, and it is the\npath Vite serves from `public/`. In dev one rewrite in vite.config.ts keeps\nthe two identical.\n\n`PATIENT_BASE_URL` moves the page under Daguito''s own domain — the full url\nof the route Daguito exposes, optionally with `{id}` when their router''s\nroute IS the consultation. Setting it moves the link the doctor copies AND\nopens the CORS allow-list for that origin, from the one module that resolves\nboth, so they cannot point at different hosts.\n\nThe moment the page is not next to the bundle, two things it used to read off\nits own hostname stop being derivable: which API to call and where panel.js\nis. The link carries both, and the page ignores any value that is not under\ndaguito.com — a forwarded link cannot be rewritten to send its token to\nsomebody else''s server. The api base comes from the Host of the request that\nmints the link (cloudflared passes the original through), with API_BASE_URL\nto override it.\n\nThe id stays in the fragment: a fragment is never sent to a server, so a\npatient''s visit is not a line in anybody''s access log — Daguito''s included.\n`{id}` gives that up, which is why it is opt-in and documented as such.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JmY3Fk4DG3JGZHnmxYoavs","tree":{"sha":"1ca29e88a1f36e15cbb517e735129267fa7224dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/1ca29e88a1f36e15cbb517e735129267fa7224dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/db44d5f854e99fe2b7f5bbb83e7ac9f033f848c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/db44d5f854e99fe2b7f5bbb83e7ac9f033f848c6","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKGRiNDRkNWY4NTRlOTlmZTJiN2Y1YmJiODNlN2FjOWYwMzNmODQ4YzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/4422a1c492ba62b21afcbf70f68d81d6496c367d","sha":"4422a1c492ba62b21afcbf70f68d81d6496c367d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/4422a1c492ba62b21afcbf70f68d81d6496c367d"}],"sha":"db44d5f854e99fe2b7f5bbb83e7ac9f033f848c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/db44d5f854e99fe2b7f5bbb83e7ac9f033f848c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/4422a1c492ba62b21afcbf70f68d81d6496c367d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T02:31:51Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T02:31:51Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"patient: the parent''s page is a screen, not a black box\n\nEverything used to start on load: getUserMedia, the AudioContext and the\nroom. On iOS — most of the phones this link is opened on — an AudioContext\nbuilt outside a user gesture stays suspended, and nothing flows through a\nsuspended graph. The mixer sits between the microphone and MicStream, so the\nsocket opened, the flow said `ready`, and not one word was ever sent. A\npermission dialog that appears on its own, on a page the parent has never\nseen, also gets denied.\n\nSo there is a screen before the room: who the visit is for, what the\nmicrophone is for, one button. The AudioContext is created inside that click\nhandler, synchronously, before any await.\n\nThe microphone is a state and not a boolean. A refusal says how to undo it, a\ndrop retries on its own up a backoff table (the common case is a parent who\nclicks the link before the doctor presses start), and both offer a retry that\ndoes not need a reload. The chip carries a real RMS meter, for the same\nreason the doctor''s header does: connected-and-hearing-nothing has to look\ndifferent from working.\n\nAlso: one mute for both channels — Jitsi''s own toolbar silenced the room\nwhile the microphone kept feeding `<session>:patient`, so a parent who muted\nto cough was still being transcribed. A wake lock and a visibility handler,\nbecause a phone that locks suspends the context and the channel goes quiet\nwith nothing on screen changing. Hanging up ends the page instead of leaving\na black rectangle with a live microphone in it, and a room that fails to load\nsays so and offers to try again.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JmY3Fk4DG3JGZHnmxYoavs","tree":{"sha":"d6476edc2083c435752e790d188820185010d307","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/d6476edc2083c435752e790d188820185010d307"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/4422a1c492ba62b21afcbf70f68d81d6496c367d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/4422a1c492ba62b21afcbf70f68d81d6496c367d","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKDQ0MjJhMWM0OTJiYTYyYjIxYWZjYmY3MGY2OGQ4MWQ2NDk2YzM2N2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/ccb53a0cd2488291ceb5d8a25c1868bec21085df","sha":"ccb53a0cd2488291ceb5d8a25c1868bec21085df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/ccb53a0cd2488291ceb5d8a25c1868bec21085df"}],"sha":"4422a1c492ba62b21afcbf70f68d81d6496c367d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/4422a1c492ba62b21afcbf70f68d81d6496c367d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/ccb53a0cd2488291ceb5d8a25c1868bec21085df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T02:31:40Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T02:31:40Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"consultations: pressing «iniciar» no longer reloads the screen\n\nStarting a consultation PATCHes the status and then reloaded the workspace,\nand `reload()` is the FOREGROUND load: it sets `loading`, and the guard at\nthe top of the screen returned a spinner from there. So the whole tree\nunmounted between the PATCH and its answer — the Jitsi iframe with it. The\ndoctor was dropped out of the room and re-joined a new one (its clock back at\n00:00 while the consultation''s kept counting), the dock rebuilt and the\nassistant scrolled back to the top.\n\nThe same went for `state.error`: one timed-out poll — and there is one every\nfive seconds while recording — took the room down and showed a full-page\nerror.\n\nThe spinner is now for the first paint only, and an error with a workspace on\nscreen reports itself in place, next to the panels. `setStatus` asks for a\nbackground refresh instead: same request, without turning `loading` back on.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JmY3Fk4DG3JGZHnmxYoavs","tree":{"sha":"67de152ec80b2e0ae7cd046b74eb5d3cfd895094","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/