8a25c1868bec21085df"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/d9459120180a401d1812e0f119d8d67fb437a359/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T01:36:00Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T01:36:00Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"fix(api): the assistant thread sorted its ids as text\n\nThe chat came back with the answer above the question that asked it. The\nrows were right — bigserial ids, correct timestamps, doctor inserted before\nassistant — and the ORDER BY was wrong in a way that only shows up late:\n\n  SELECT id::text, role, body, created_at ... ORDER BY id\n\n`id` is also the name of the OUTPUT column, which this SELECT casts to text\nso the panel gets a string, and Postgres resolves a bare ORDER BY to the\noutput column before the table''s. So the thread was sorted as text: \"10\"\nabove \"9\", and from the tenth message on the order came apart. Nine messages\nof testing would never have caught it.\n\nQualified with the table name, in listChat and in listTranscript, which has\nthe same shape and would break ties between two segments heard in the same\nsecond. The regression test is eleven messages — the cheapest thing that\nfails without the fix (verified: it does).\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017Uz1nqU8mUSmbRLYHE2zeY","tree":{"sha":"5cd06999bfd08aa0028b27184eba05f3e39acc3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/5cd06999bfd08aa0028b27184eba05f3e39acc3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/d9459120180a401d1812e0f119d8d67fb437a359","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/d9459120180a401d1812e0f119d8d67fb437a359","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKGQ5NDU5MTIwMTgwYTQwMWQxODEyZTBmMTE5ZDhkNjdmYjQzN2EzNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/67de31da78caab3506d31c99d315504ce017f619","sha":"67de31da78caab3506d31c99d315504ce017f619","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/67de31da78caab3506d31c99d315504ce017f619"}],"sha":"d9459120180a401d1812e0f119d8d67fb437a359","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/d9459120180a401d1812e0f119d8d67fb437a359"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/67de31da78caab3506d31c99d315504ce017f619/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T00:05:35Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T00:05:35Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"panel: its sections are sidebar rows, and its Tamagui stops borrowing the host''s\n\nThree things, and the middle one is a crash.\n\nThe manifest publishes ONE ROW PER SECTION instead of a single row with a tab\nbar inside the page. The old argument — that our sections would be scattered\namong the host''s own — stopped holding for this client the day the org hid\nthose rows: the menu holds this panel and little else. Two navigations for the\nsame two screens was also the wrong one, because the panel cannot tell the\nhost which section is open (lib/route.ts writes the URL deliberately without\nthe host''s route event), so an in-panel switch left the sidebar highlighting\nthe section the doctor had just left. Switching now costs a re-mount; for two\nsections nobody can see it.\n\nThe crash: React #321 in the consultation chat, every time. Tamagui keeps its\nconfig on `globalThis.__tamaguiConfig`, and each component binds one when it is\nCREATED — `onConfiguredOnce` reads `local || global` and, being \"once\", never\nlets go. Daguito is a Tamagui app and had already left its config on that\nglobal, so every component of @tamagui/core created before our `createTamagui`\nbound the HOST''s, then took `config.animations.ResetPresence` out of it — a\ncomponent from the host''s bundle — and our React rendered it. The build''s\nbanner hides that global before a single module of ours runs, and theme/config\nhands it back afterwards: the host''s pages are `React.lazy`, so the ones\ncreated after we load were binding OUR config, the same bug pointing the other\nway.\n\nAnd a render error now stops at a boundary instead of taking the root down and\nbeing re-mounted by the host — which read as the panel reloading itself rather\nthan as a bug with a stack. It prints the component stack, on screen as well as\nin the console, because this panel is read on a phone.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017Uz1nqU8mUSmbRLYHE2zeY","tree":{"sha":"09054b404c12db9e445d090d15c3d60cc48b588f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/09054b404c12db9e445d090d15c3d60cc48b588f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/67de31da78caab3506d31c99d315504ce017f619","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/67de31da78caab3506d31c99d315504ce017f619","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKDY3ZGUzMWRhNzhjYWFiMzUwNmQzMWM5OWQzMTU1MDRjZTAxN2Y2MTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/5377c6723f55f2ed121800be7962ed3a801dbd07","sha":"5377c6723f55f2ed121800be7962ed3a801dbd07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/5377c6723f55f2ed121800be7962ed3a801dbd07"}],"sha":"67de31da78caab3506d31c99d315504ce017f619","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/67de31da78caab3506d31c99d315504ce017f619"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/5377c6723f55f2ed121800be7962ed3a801dbd07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T00:05:20Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T00:05:20Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"panel: the note and the assistant are markdown — render them as such\n\nEverything the doctor reads on the consultation screen is markdown and none\nof it was typed by hand: the note comes out of `c_soap` against a template\nwhose headings ARE `##`, and the assistant answers the way every chat model\ndoes. Shown verbatim it reads as broken output, with the emphasis landing on\nthe asterisks instead of on the dose.\n\nNo library: a subset of CommonMark that fits in one file, every rule a pure\nfunction under test. It supports what the two writers actually emit and lets\neverything else fall through as the text it was, which is the only failure\nmode worth having in a clinical record. Two deliberate departures — `[[hueco]]`\nis not a link, so a template body survives to the screen as typed, and a soft\nline break stays a break instead of collapsing into a space.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017Uz1nqU8mUSmbRLYHE2zeY","tree":{"sha":"d8bdb7a3c9ea8647625b3b7150060c407664fedc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/d8bdb7a3c9ea8647625b3b7150060c407664fedc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/5377c6723f55f2ed121800be7962ed3a801dbd07","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/5377c6723f55f2ed121800be7962ed3a801dbd07","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKDUzNzdjNjcyM2Y1NWYyZWQxMjE4MDBiZTc5NjJlZDNhODAxZGJkMDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/95ee0e59ee2f04b527f3a06f1a987a784f83692b","sha":"95ee0e59ee2f04b527f3a06f1a987a784f83692b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/95ee0e59ee2f04b527f3a06f1a987a784f83692b"}],"sha":"5377c6723f55f2ed121800be7962ed3a801dbd07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/5377c6723f55f2ed121800be7962ed3a801dbd07"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/95ee0e59ee2f04b527f3a06f1a987a784f83692b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T00:05:06Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T00:05:06Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"infra: give the task what the API actually reads, and pin the DB it runs on\n\nThe ECS task definition was missing four things the API reads at boot, and\neach failed quietly: DAGUITO_STREAM_API_KEY (its SSM parameter existed and\nnobody injected it, so /stream/token and /chat answered 503 — a consultation\nwith no engine), PANEL_BASE_URL (the patient''s link and the CORS allow-list,\nwhich have to agree), and R2_ACCOUNT_ID/R2_BUCKET together with the two R2\ncredentials — the parameters were created and never handed to the container,\nso uploads went to the task''s own disk, which the next deploy throws away.\n\nThe RDS module moves to Postgres 18, in step with the image in\ndocker-compose.dev.yml: dev and prod on different MAJORS is a gap no test can\nsee, because the tests run against dev and the migrations run against prod.\nDeletion protection goes ON — what is in that database is the clinical record\nand it exists in exactly one place.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017Uz1nqU8mUSmbRLYHE2zeY","tree":{"sha":"04e698372e2258307e5c3ec9730b4c5d085fac97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/04e698372e2258307e5c3ec9730b4c5d085fac97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/95ee0e59ee2f04b527f3a06f1a987a784f83692b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/95ee0e59ee2f04b527f3a06f1a987a784f83692b","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKDk1ZWUwZTU5ZWUyZjA0YjUyN2YzYTA2ZjFhOTg3YTc4NGY4MzY5MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/98b4a8d0dcb9fa102bbfcca205f7de653d6160bc","sha":"98b4a8d0dcb9fa102bbfcca205f7de653d6160bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/98b4a8d0dcb9fa102bbfcca205f7de653d6160bc"}],"sha":"95ee0e59ee2f04b527f3a06f1a987a784f83692b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/95ee0e59ee2f04b527f3a06f1a987a784f83692b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dagui