run beside another one —\nthe whole reason they are configurable — got tunnels pointed at the\nOTHER custom''s stack: real HTTPS hostnames serving somebody else''s API,\nwith nothing to indicate it. The ports now come from infra/.env, the\nsame fallback shape tunnel.sh already used for the dev slug.\n\ninfra/.env: slug dev2, PANEL_PUBLIC_HOST and the panel''s tunnel origin\nadded to ALLOWED_ORIGIN so the browser may call the API from it.\n\nAlso a template papercut: consulting-somos-cocuy has the same script.","tree":{"sha":"d40433fddacf11f220d5de03e40ae4eb47efca8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/d40433fddacf11f220d5de03e40ae4eb47efca8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/336c66901b4e777d34c8d6e55b80b2f31b4ea5dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/336c66901b4e777d34c8d6e55b80b2f31b4ea5dc","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKDMzNmM2NjkwMWI0ZTc3N2QzNGM4ZDZlNTViODBiMmYzMWI0ZWE1ZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/b5259b490a983122078c9a647d96ebe3cb7586c0","sha":"b5259b490a983122078c9a647d96ebe3cb7586c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/b5259b490a983122078c9a647d96ebe3cb7586c0"}],"sha":"336c66901b4e777d34c8d6e55b80b2f31b4ea5dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/336c66901b4e777d34c8d6e55b80b2f31b4ea5dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/b5259b490a983122078c9a647d96ebe3cb7586c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T01:50:48Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T01:50:48Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"dev: the harness signs its own token again\n\nscripts/dev-credentials.ts reads infra/.env and infra/.dev-jwt/, and the\npanel container mounted only apps/panel — so the plugin answered\n''infra/.env no existe'' and every page in the harness was a 401 until\nsomebody pasted a token by hand. Mounted read-only; the panel has no\nbusiness writing there.\n\nThis is the template''s papercut, not this custom''s: consulting-somos-cocuy\nhas the same compose file.","tree":{"sha":"d1cfd5bc7f7f1befcc3bb8fa12b1c71170218a2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/d1cfd5bc7f7f1befcc3bb8fa12b1c71170218a2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/b5259b490a983122078c9a647d96ebe3cb7586c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/b5259b490a983122078c9a647d96ebe3cb7586c0","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKGI1MjU5YjQ5MGE5ODMxMjIwNzhjOWE2NDdkOTZlYmUzY2I3NTg2YzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/a237c5b03c8269c56fffcba5c6cad22e91d693f9","sha":"a237c5b03c8269c56fffcba5c6cad22e91d693f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/a237c5b03c8269c56fffcba5c6cad22e91d693f9"}],"sha":"b5259b490a983122078c9a647d96ebe3cb7586c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/b5259b490a983122078c9a647d96ebe3cb7586c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/a237c5b03c8269c56fffcba5c6cad22e91d693f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T21:09:52Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T21:10:06Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"consultations: the microphone was gated shut — stream continuously, and show the level\n\nThe transcription never produced a word, and the engine was not the\nproblem. Proved it by pushing 14 s of real speech straight into the\nin-person flow from the API, with no browser: transcript.final came back\ntwice, c_facts raised the questions and c_soap wrote the SOAP. Then the\nsame audio through the panel''s exact path — our /stream/token, the\n:doctor sub-channel, our routes — and the words landed in the database.\n\nSo the fault was the panel''s, and it was the VAD:\n\n    vad: { enabled: true }\n\nis what the legacy app uses to stop paying the transcriber for silence,\nand it is also a gate that can close over an entire consultation. A quiet\nroom, a distant microphone or a laptop with aggressive noise suppression\nnever crosses the RMS threshold, nothing is sent, and the panel sits on\n\"Escuchando\" with an empty transcript. Audio now streams continuously;\ngating it again is an optimisation to make deliberately.\n\nAnd so the failure can never be invisible again, the badge shows the\nmicrophone''s LEVEL: \"Escuchando · entra audio\" vs \"Escuchando · sin audio\ndel micrófono\". A dead mic looks exactly like a working one until the\nconsultation is over, which is the worst moment to find out.\n\nAlso from the live run: diarization labels its first finals PENDING and\nsettles them later, which printed the word \"PENDING\" above the first\nsentence of every consultation. PENDING/UNKNOWN is now no speaker, and\nthe transform reads the words from \"transcript\" as well as \"text\".\n\nJitsi stays open for every kind of consultation for now, as asked — the\nrule that only a video consultation opens its room is kept in\nautoJoinsMeeting, one line away, and starting a presencial still needs no\nroom at all.\n\n88 API tests + 48 panel tests.","tree":{"sha":"51a3ec9a96c595eaf1b0c85752c0fb68d70cf289","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/51a3ec9a96c595eaf1b0c85752c0fb68d70cf289"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/a237c5b03c8269c56fffcba5c6cad22e91d693f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/a237c5b03c8269c56fffcba5c6cad22e91d693f9","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKGEyMzdjNWIwM2M4MjY5YzU2ZmZmY2JhNWM2Y2FkMjJlOTFkNjkzZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/be15fb171158e7af71659206212057572840f53f","sha":"be15fb171158e7af71659206212057572840f53f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/be15fb171158e7af71659206212057572840f53f"}],"sha":"a237c5b03c8269c56fffcba5c6cad22e91d693f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/a237c5b03c8269c56fffcba5c6cad22e91d693f9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/be15fb171158e7af71659206212057572840f53f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:34:10Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:34:10Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"consultations: the assistant answers — it is the consultation-chatbot flow\n\nThe chat panel kept the thread and nobody replied. The assistant is an\nAGENT flow on Daguito (''Dr. Midulabs'' in the legacy product), in the same\naccount as the transcription flows, so POST /chat now saves the doctor''s\nmessage, runs ONE turn against it and saves the answer.\n\nTwo things measured against the live flow:\n\n- the session key is chatbot:<consultation id>, never the bare id. The\n  transcription flow already owns that key and sharing it fans live\n  transcript fragments into the chat bubble;\n- a completed agent run answers with a RUN TRACE, not a string: the reply\n  is output.steps[].data.output.content on the agent step. The first\n  version looked for reply/text/message, found none, and the doctor got\n  an empty answer while the agent had written a full one — a 34 s turn\n  that produced nothing on screen.\n\nThe doctor''s message is persisted BEFORE the turn and never lost if the\nengine fails (202 + assistant_error). A run that says nothing writes no\nmessage: a blank bubble in a clinical thread is worse than silence. A\nmessage written as ''assistant'' does not trigger another turn.\n\nVerified end to end against api.daguito.com: asked about paracetamol\ndosing for 16 kg and chest x-ray indications, got real answers with the\nagent''s own web_search tool calls behind them.\n\n88 API tests + 46 panel tests.","tree":{"sha":"d7e92fd5d5ea7d0f24d70cefd5bb5e65c5ac392a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/d7e92fd5d5ea7d0f24d70cefd5bb5e65c5ac392a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/be15fb171158e7af71659206212057572840f53f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/be15fb171158e7af71659206212057572840f53f","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKGJlMTVmYjE3MTE1OGU3YWY3MTY1OTIwNjIxMjA1NzU3Mjg0MGY1M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/e3667831ac8fa004b5a1b67c58f913c87be8ea9d","sha":"e3667831ac8fa004b5a1b67c58f913c87be8ea9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/e3667831ac8fa004b5a1b67c58f913c87be8ea9d"}],"sha":"be15fb171158e7af71659206212057572840f53f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/be15fb171158e7af71659206212057572840f53f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/e3667831ac8fa004b5a1b67c58f913c87be8ea9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:20:58Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:20:58Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"consultations: the Daguito flows drive the consultation, and only a video call needs a room\n\nThe engine is the legacy product''s, in the SAME Daguito account: the API\nresolves the flow by slug (realtime / in-person / pre-recorded-consultation),\nopens the session and mints a short bidi token per consultation, and the panel\nstreams the mic in and reads c_facts / c_soap out with @daguito/sdk. Everything\nthe flow produces is written back through OUR routes, so the record lives in\nthis custom''s database and not in a websocket that ended.\n\nlib/flow-transform.ts is a faithful port of the legacy transform (the four\nrecommendation buckets, the low-confidence marker, the SOAP assembly), tested\non its own.\n\nThree things the live run corrected:\n\n- audio goes to <session>:doctor, not the bare session key. The graph declares\n  audio_session_suffix: ''doctor'', so the STT node listens there and nowhere\n  else. Sending to the base key fails in the worst way: socket open, level\n  meter moving, flow says ready, zero events for 30 s of speech;\n- joining the room no longer flips the consultation to ''recording''. It did,\n  so ''Iniciar consulta'' never appeared and the engine was never started —\n  being in a room and recording a consultation are different things;\n- NOT every consultation is a video call. A presencial is two people and one\n  microphone, and a transcripción is an upload: neither needs the room to\n  start, and neither opens a camera because a screen was opened. The room\n  stays available for all of them, behind a button.\n\nAlso: a room whose end was never recorded (a closed laptop) no longer runs\nthe clock forever — an eight-minute consultation read 6:14:07 the morning\nafter.\n\n82 API tests + 46 panel tests.","tree":{"sha":"efaa8f189d5aa0b8673f1760603883d9f335dfa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/efaa8f189d5aa0b8673f1760603883d9f335dfa8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/e3667831ac8fa004b5a1b67c58f913c87be8ea9d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/e3667831ac8fa004b5a1b67c58f913c87be8ea9d","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKGUzNjY3ODMxYWM4ZmEwMDRiNWExYjY3YzU4ZjkxM2M4N2JlOGVhOWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/d1ef0dfbda62f910b7547ce265f8fac7f31d7fd3","sha":"d1ef0dfbda62f910b7547ce265f8fac7f31d7fd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/d1ef0dfbda62f910b7547ce265f8fac7f31d7fd3"}],"sha":"e3667831ac8fa004b5a1b67c58f913c87be8ea9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/e3667831ac8fa004b5a1b67c58f913c87be8ea9d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/d1ef0dfbda62f910b7547ce265f8fac7f31d7fd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T19:48:23Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T19:48:23Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"consultations: the detail screen, four panels around the room\n\nPorts the legacy /dashboard/consultation/:id layout: the meeting on the\nleft with the assistant and the transcript under it, the recommendations\nand the clinical note on the right, a header carrying the clock, the\n''ingresa a la reunión para iniciar'' guard and the start/stop button.\n\nMigration 0005 gives the screen its four tables (transcript segments,\nrecommendations, one note per consultation, chat messages) and\n/api/consultations/:id/workspace reads them in ONE round trip — the\nlegacy page fired five and flashed four empty panels in sequence.\n\nRules worth naming:\n- a note the DOCTOR wrote is never overwritten by the engine. The legacy\n  screen re-rendered the template on every flow emission and wiped edits\n  made minutes earlier;\n- the same suggestion arriving twice is one row (folded + de-punctuated\n  unique index): the engine re-emits its whole list as it goes;\n- the clock is derived from the consultation, so a reload does not send\n  it back to 00:00;\n- a transcript is stored in segments with the second they were spoken at,\n  not appended to one text column.\n\nAlso fixes an ordering bug found by its own test: (status = ''featured'')\nis NULL for untouched rows and a DESC sort puts NULLs first, so the\npinned recommendation sorted BELOW the rest.\n\nThe layout is a grid, not the legacy flexlayout dock: this panel gets\nhalf a screen inside Daguito and the one thing the dock was used for —\nmaximise — is a button per panel.\n\nNOT included, and it is the next stage: the engine that FILLS the\ntranscript, the recommendations and the note. In midulabs that is a set\nof Daguito flows (c_facts / c_soap + the ''Dr. Midulabs'' agent) driven by\nMicStream/OutputStream. It writes through these same routes, so the\nscreen does not change when it is turned on.\n\n78 API tests + 28 panel tests.","tree":{"sha":"978c475bdf67a87328f2a519d8484cfc0abc6ccb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/978c475bdf67a87328f2a519d8484cfc0abc6ccb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/d1ef0dfbda62f910b7547ce265f8fac7f31d7fd3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/d1ef0dfbda62f910b7547ce265f8fac7f31d7fd3","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKGQxZWYwZGZiZGE2MmY5MTBiNzU0N2NlMjY1ZjhmYWM3ZjMxZDdmZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/27bad0d78849f0447386e93b852eee1a34590d2f","sha":"27bad0d78849f0447386e93b852eee1a34590d2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/27bad0d78849f0447386e93b852eee1a34590d2f"}],"sha":"d1ef0dfbda62f910b7547ce265f8fac7f31d7fd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/d1ef0dfbda62f910b7547ce265f8fac7f31d7fd3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/27bad0d78849f0447386e93b852eee1a34590d2f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T19:19:39Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T19:19:39Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"consultations: a Jitsi room for every kind of consultation\n\nThe legacy app minted a room only when the mode was not in_person\n(\"Generate Jitsi Token only for video mode\", service/consultation.go),\nso the office consultation — the common one in a paediatric practice —\ncould not pull in a parent who could not come, a second opinion or an\ninterpreter. Every consultation owns a room here, whatever its mode;\nopening it is the doctor''s decision, not a column''s.\n\nAPI: migration 0004 gives each consultation a random room name (not one\nderived from its id: in public mode the name IS the access control) plus\nmeeting_started_at/ended_at. lib/jitsi.ts signs the same HS256 claim\nshape the deployed Jitsi already accepts (iss=sub=aud=APP_ID, room,\ncontext.user, moderator-only features). GET/POST .../meeting[/start|end]\nhand the panel a domain + token and bank the time the room was open,\ncomputed server-side — a browser that closed its laptop reports nothing.\n\nPanel: the room mounts in a modal from Jitsi''s external_api.js, loaded\nfrom the domain the API names at runtime. No @jitsi/react-sdk: the\nbundle is a micro-frontend that shares no React with the host, and the\nwrapper only injects that same script.\n\nTwo things the live run corrected:\n- a self-signed token sent to meet.jit.si is refused (''no tienes permiso\n  para unirte''), which is worse than sending none. Credentials plus the\n  public domain is now a boot-time warning and a public room;\n- videoConferenceJoined never fired on a room that visibly had our\n  participant in it, so nothing was banked. The meeting starts when the\n  room is opened; the event is kept as a free second stamp.\n\nTerraform carries JITSI_DOMAIN/APP_ID as env and APP_SECRET as an SSM\nSecureString. 61 API tests + 22 panel tests.","tree":{"sha":"b6f665b73c7912769ccb526701244e9b3bb00a20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/b6f665b73c7912769ccb526701244e9b3bb00a20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/27bad0d78849f0447386e93b852eee1a34590d2f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/27bad0d78849f0447386e93b852eee1a34590d2f","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKDI3YmFkMGQ3ODg0OWYwNDQ3Mzg2ZTkzYjg1MmVlZTFhMzQ1OTBkMmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/27fd22a9af7744de44d428b73f4816f4799a8cc1","sha":"27fd22a9af7744de44d428b73f4816f4799a8cc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/27fd22a9af7744de44d428b73f4816f4799a8cc1"}],"sha":"27bad0d78849f0447386e93b852eee1a34590d2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/27bad0d78849f0447386e93b852eee1a34590d2f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/27fd22a9af7744de44d428b73f4816f4799a8cc1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T19:04:10Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T19:04:18Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"consultations: the legacy /dashboard/consultations section, end to end\n\nPorted from midulabs (React + MUI DataGrid over a Go/GORM API) onto this\ncustom''s stack: migrations 0002/0003, an Elysia module (routes + repos)\nand one panel section built from the shared components.\n\nKept from the original: tabs by consultation type, the debounced name\nsearch ANDed with a single-day picker, server-side pagination and\nsorting, the rename dialog, the poll while a transcription is\nprocessing, and the rule that a draft is never listed.\n\nChanged on purpose:\n- the tenant is the ORG, not one doctor''s user_id;\n- the mode filter is SQL, not a filter over the ten rows already\n  paginated, so page 2 of a tab is the second ten of that tab;\n- the tabs carry counts, and the counts honour the search;\n- the name is searched and sorted through pediatric_fold (0003), so\n  \"maria\" finds \"María\" and lowercase does not sort last;\n- a row offers only the actions its status allows;\n- the plan/quota banner is gone: metering is the host''s, not a panel''s.\n\nOut of scope, and it depends on the legacy AI service: the recording and\ntranscription pipeline, the chatbot, the LLM model picker and the\nknowledge bases, plus the /dashboard/consultation/:id detail screen.\n\n41 API tests (a real Postgres) + 14 panel unit tests.","tree":{"sha":"3f790b732391382fb885eb8436540e819262257b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/3f790b732391382fb885eb8436540e819262257b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/27fd22a9af7744de44d428b73f4816f4799a8cc1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/27fd22a9af7744de44d428b73f4816f4799a8cc1","node_id":"C_kwDOUQar0NoAKDI3ZmQyMmE5YWY3NzQ0ZGU0NGQ0MjhiNzNmNDgxNmY0Nzk5YThjYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commit/203329cfce57ae246f261da4a66d8872adb29fc7","sha":"203329cfce57ae246f261da4a66d8872adb29fc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/203329cfce57ae246f261da4a66d8872adb29fc7"}],"sha":"27fd22a9af7744de44d428b73f4816f4799a8cc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/27fd22a9af7744de44d428b73f4816f4799a8cc1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CamiloArias12","id":127451734,"login":"CamiloArias12","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jCVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/commits/203329cfce57ae246f261da4a66d8872adb29fc7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T18:46:32Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T18:46:32Z","email":"ariaspira13@gmail.com","name":"CamiloArias"},"message":"pediatric: custom bootstrapped from the Daguito template\n\nPlatform only — auth + org allow-list, /api/status, agent functions,\ncontact-field sync, webhook receiver, R2 storage, the panel shell with\nDaguito''s vendored design system, Terraform and the RELEASE-triggered\nworkflows. No domain yet.","tree":{"sha":"2082ce894886c026a018c3a4b26c1831c37ce7bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/trees/2082ce894886c026a018c3a4b26c1831c37ce7bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daguitocontact-lang/consulting-pediatric/git/commits/203329cfce57ae246f261da4a66d8872adb29fc7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127451734?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CamiloArias12/f