https://github.com/Praneelpandey","id":161029077,"login":"Praneelpandey","node_id":"U_kgDOCZkb1Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Praneelpandey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Praneelpandey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Praneelpandey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Praneelpandey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Praneelpandey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Praneelpandey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/55b615d39afeacc681b436b0557c0a340087e53a","node_id":"C_kwDOUQcccdoAKDU1YjYxNWQzOWFmZWFjYzY4MWI0MzZiMDU1N2MwYTM0MDA4N2U1M2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/cee2c96d5e717d6f5057ee6a78ca8a6031063b30","sha":"cee2c96d5e717d6f5057ee6a78ca8a6031063b30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/cee2c96d5e717d6f5057ee6a78ca8a6031063b30"}],"sha":"55b615d39afeacc681b436b0557c0a340087e53a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/55b615d39afeacc681b436b0557c0a340087e53a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/d732201aa7e34898c938c4647556e99cdd33643d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T20:37:00Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T20:37:00Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"message":"backend: port newer work from the parallel sih26043 line (auto-eval + AUTO access rule)\n\nBrings this repo''s backend/ up to the state of yogesh856/sih26043 @ 728c402, which is\nthe same codebase continued in parallel: same modules, same package, but with the last\nfew features. Everything is placed under backend/ so the layout matches this repo.\n\nAdditive only — nothing here deletes anyone''s work. Checking file-by-file, this repo''s\nbackend/ was identical to the other line apart from five files it alone had, and those\nare all kept:\n  - dot-matrix-effect/{README.md,index.html}\n  - seed-sample-cases.ps1\n  - source-service/.../V2__seed_dev_users.sql\n  - the .gitignore \"Compiled Binaries\" section\n  - test-ui/index.html''s baseUrl placeholder (8090, kept over the other line''s 8080)\nTwo path-sensitive files (Dockerfile.codejudge, docker-compose.yml) are taken as a pair\nfrom the newer line, since their build context is `context: .` + `codejudge-service/…`\nrather than this repo''s `context: ./codejudge-service` + `../Dockerfile.codejudge`.\n\nWhat arrives:\n- evaluation-service: per-pool MANUAL/AUTO AI evaluator (V4__auto_evaluation.sql), the\n  criterion scoring client, AutoEvaluationService, ScoreAggregationService,\n  PrioritizationService, EvaluationCompletionService, EvaluatorPoolModeController,\n  and the EVALUATION_AUTO_ENABLED kill switch in docker-compose\n- problem-service: the 4th access rule AUTO_SELECTED_UNIVERSITIES (V4 + V5 migrations,\n  the university/university_domain catalog seeded across all 12 root domains, the LLM\n  domain-resolution client, AutoUniversitySelectionService, ProblemSubmissionService,\n  which is deliberately not @Transactional). Fails closed: no model, bad output or an\n  empty intersection is a 400, never a widened audience\n- portal-service: V2 adds the enum value to access_rule, and ParticipantService treats\n  it exactly like SELECTED_UNIVERSITIES. This migration and the portal enum must deploy\n  together — enumOf() returning null would silently republish a restricted problem as\n  OPEN_TO_ALL\n- edith-common: the 4th ProblemAccessRule value + the new AuditAction constants\n- new docs: backend/problem-service.md, backend/portalservice.md\n- actor-ui: portal.html console + the evaluator console expansion\n\nMigration numbering, one real collision: this repo had\nevaluation-service/V4__seed_demo_evaluator_profile.sql while the other line had already\nused V4 for V4__auto_evaluation.sql. The demo seed is renamed to\nV5__seed_demo_evaluator_profile.sql so both run, and so the two repos keep the same\nnumbering going forward. Any already-migrated evaluation DB (either side) needs a\nflyway repair or a fresh volume, because that version''s file changed underneath it.\n\nTests on the source line: source 7, evaluation 165, problem 47, portal 47, codejudge 66.","tree":{"sha":"1f9a6d1874c49f8047506a64a3e81ed805a4bf6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/trees/1f9a6d1874c49f8047506a64a3e81ed805a4bf6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/commits/d732201aa7e34898c938c4647556e99cdd33643d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1963527