huleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"message":"portal-service: published problem portal + project submissions & reviews\n\nNew portal-service (:8084, DB sih_portal) publishes problems automatically\nat EVALUATION_COMPLETED and lets participants (students on OPEN_TO_ALL,\nuniversity leads on restricted) submit projects that go back to the same\nevaluator who scored the problem for an ACCEPT/RETURN decision.\n\n- edith-common: SourceAccountDetail + AuditAction PROBLEM_PUBLISHED /\n  PROJECT_REVIEW_ASSIGNED / PROJECT_REVIEW_DECIDED\n- source-service: GET /internal/users/{userId}/source-accounts lookup\n  (HEI detection for first-contact auto-bind)\n- portal-service: participants, published catalog, teams, submissions,\n  multipart files (V1__portal_schema.sql)\n- evaluation-service: V3__project_review.sql, ProjectReview state machine,\n  PortalPublishService (best-effort publish + review-result notify), and\n  /internal/** opened for service-to-service intake\n- actor-ui/evaluator.html: project-review console section","tree":{"sha":"d09a6b3b9c066bd9ae3c0cb191a2affbe8aac4c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/trees/d09a6b3b9c066bd9ae3c0cb191a2affbe8aac4c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/commits/f042acab7ec62673ddbd27487768e10c7ddabeaa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.git