fcf3fb0ded22535e9c48966e0214a443314d4e36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T19:32:59Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T19:32:59Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"message":"docs: add evaluation-service planning & design notes\n\nConsolidates every planning decision behind the Phase-2 evaluation engine:\narchitecture/topology, planning history, locked product-owner rules\n(bucket->pool routing, one least-loaded evaluator, auto-route after analyze),\nthe sih_eval data model, cycle + assignment state machines, full HTTP surface\n(admin pipeline, profile onboarding, /evaluation/me/*), intake/analyze/route\ndesigns, the AI analysis client + heuristic fallback and their known quirks,\nrecorded gotchas, testing, deploy & verify recipe, and the unbuilt aggregation/\nprioritisation roadmap with the 1-evaluator-vs-5-pool-weights open question.","tree":{"sha":"fc168cd841e34aa4d4bdd3fdd9e2df286365024f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/trees/fc168cd841e34aa4d4bdd3fdd9e2df286365024f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/commits/fcf3fb0ded22535e9c48966e0214a443314d4e36","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/fcf3fb0ded22535e9c48966e0214a443314d4e36","node_id":"C_kwDOUQcccdoAKGZjZjNmYjBkZWQyMjUzNWU5YzQ4OTY2ZTAyMTRhNDQzMzE0ZDRlMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/e925e8107ea4bec7b7b91510123939ba3d01b0d8","sha":"e925e8107ea4bec7b7b91510123939ba3d01b0d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/e925e8107ea4bec7b7b91510123939ba3d01b0d8"}],"sha":"fcf3fb0ded22535e9c48966e0214a443314d4e36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/fcf3fb0ded22535e9c48966e0214a443314d4e36"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/e925e8107ea4bec7b7b91510123939ba3d01b0d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T19:32:49Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T19:32:49Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"message":"Retire the last monolith residue (no application monolith remains)\n\nThe app/ module and its compose service were already gone since Step 5; this\nremoves everything that still said \"monolith / until Step N\".\n\n- Dockerfile.app -> Dockerfile.service: JAR_FILE build arg now has no default\n  (a missing arg fails the build loudly instead of silently embedding another\n  service''s jar), EXPOSE dropped (port is per-service SERVER_PORT), app.jar ->\n  service.jar. Compose''s 4 dockerfile refs updated.\n- Image tags :step5/:step6 -> :local.\n- Stale \"monolith / until Step N / strangler extraction\" prose rewritten in the\n  three service pom descriptions, the service @SpringBootApplication javadocs,\n  the internal-client and service javadocs, SecurityConfig, AuditLog, compose\n  header and Caddyfile. Flyway migration comments deliberately left alone —\n  they are provenance, and editing an applied migration breaks checksum.\n- The stale monolithic sih26043 database (21 MB, 49 tables) was dumped to\n  data/monolith-sih26043-final-dump.sql (gitignored) and dropped.\n\nVerified: full reactor package green, docker compose up --build (6/6 containers\non :local), gateway smoke 200 across all three services.","tree":{"sha":"5cda1c7c37e784931a1688416b0af672d1cf7202","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/trees/5cda1c7c37e784931a1688416b0af672d1cf7202"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/commits/e925e8107ea4bec7b7b91510123939ba3d01b0d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/e925e8107ea4bec7b7b91510123939ba3d01b0d8","node_id":"C_kwDOUQcccdoAKGU5MjVlODEwN2VhNGJlYzdiN2I5MTUxMDEyMzkzOWJhM2QwMWIwZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/98f58022d68b699aabff06d961efd49cda46fa7c","sha":"98f58022d68b699aabff06d961efd49cda46fa7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/98f58022d68b699aabff06d961efd49cda46fa7c"}],"sha":"e925e8107ea4bec7b7b91510123939ba3d01b0d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/e925e8107ea4bec7b7b91510123939ba3d01b0d8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/98f58022d68b699aabff06d961efd49cda46fa7c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T19:32:30Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T19:32:30Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"message":"Evaluator scoring: /evaluation/me/* accept/decline/submit + profile onboarding\n\nEvaluator half of the Phase-2 pipeline, so a routed problem can actually be\nscored. Adds the evaluator''s own dashboard (EvaluatorController ->\nEvaluatorAssignmentService): my profile/criteria/assignments, assignment\ndetail (problem fetched live, advisory AI profile, existing scores), and\naccept/decline/submit actions with all-or-nothing per-criterion scorecard\nvalidation against the pool''s seeded criteria. When the last open assignment\nis submitted the cycle advances to EVALUATION_COMPLETED; a decline reopens it\nto ROUTING. Deadlines are enforced lazily on write (EXPIRED, no scheduler).\n\nTwo state-machine/routing fixes required to make the flow work:\n- EvaluationStatusService.ALLOWED now permits EVALUATION_IN_PROGRESS -> ROUTING\n  (a declined problem was previously a dead end).\n- EvaluationRoutingService excludes every profile already assigned to the\n  cycle when picking a candidate, so a re-route after a decline picks someone\n  new instead of 500ing on UNIQUE (cycle_id, evaluator_profile_id).\n\nUser-requested evaluator test console (actor-ui/evaluator.html) plus the\nEVALUATOR nav entry on the existing actor pages, for e2e-testing the flow.\n\n50 unit tests green; e2e-verified through the gateway (scorecard stored,\nEVALUATION_SUBMITTED/COMPLETED audit rows, decline -> ROUTING, re-route).","tree":{"sha":"8a6a4e0d35356e6c0ab8a752a4d34e67cfe4145a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/trees/8a6a4e0d35356e6c0ab8a752a4d34e67cfe4145a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/commits/98f58022d68b699aabff06d961efd49cda46fa7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/98f58022d68b699aabff06d961efd49cda46fa7c","node_id":"C_kwDOUQcccdoAKDk4ZjU4MDIyZDY4YjY5OWFhYmZmMDZkOTYxZWZkNDljZGE0NmZhN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/7fe16e9df7f6aba413a134e1eeb6bb8e3f47c082","sha":"7fe16e9df7f6aba413a134e1eeb6bb8e3f47c082","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/7fe16e9df7f6aba413a134e1eeb6bb8e3f47c082"}],"sha":"98f58022d68b699aabff06d961efd49cda46fa7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/98f58022d68b699aabff06d961efd49cda46fa7c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/7fe16e9df7f6aba413a134e1eeb6bb8e3f47c082/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T13:37:34Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T13:37:34Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"message":"Swap Anthropic Claude for an OpenAI-compatible local LLM\n\nProblem analysis now calls a local OpenAI-compatible router\n(agentrouter/deepseek-v4-flash) over plain RestClient instead of the\nAnthropic SDK, so the anthropic-java dependency is gone.\n\nThe ProblemAnalysisClient seam meant nothing in the pipeline changed:\nProblemAnalysisService, the heuristic fallback and the state machine are\nuntouched, and the tests only needed their provider/model fixtures updated.\n\nTwo quirks of the local endpoint drove the implementation:\n- it streams Server-Sent Events unless \"stream\": false is sent explicitly,\n  which the single-shot parser cannot read;\n- it is a reasoning model that bills reasoning_content against max_tokens\n  before emitting the answer, so a 4k budget could be spent entirely on\n  thinking and return empty content (finish_reason=length). Budget raised\n  to 8k and that case is now logged distinctly from an unreachable endpoint.\n\nThe API key is a real credential, so it lives in .env (now gitignored,\nauto-loaded by compose) rather than as a docker-compose default; .env.example\ndocuments the variable. An absent key stays safe — analysis falls back to the\ndeterministic heuristic and the pipeline still routes.\n\nVerified end-to-end through the gateway: two fresh cycles analyzed with\nprovider=openai-compatible, status=SUCCESS, context-aware summaries, and\nauto-route on to EVALUATION_IN_PROGRESS. 27/27 tests green.","tree":{"sha":"c81b0db6509c66a720b946df96ee0b7c1cdc44ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/trees/c81b0db6509c66a720b946df96ee0b7c1cdc44ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/commits/7fe16e9df7f6aba413a134e1eeb6bb8e3f47c082","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/7fe16e9df7f6aba413a134e1eeb6bb8e3f47c082","node_id":"C_kwDOUQcccdoAKDdmZTE2ZTlkZjdmNmFiYTQxM2ExMzRlMWVlYjZiYjhlM2Y0N2MwODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/a084a7bcd38c30ad8d0289c5da5ffe94172b49f4","sha":"a084a7bcd38c30ad8d0289c5da5ffe94172b49f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/a084a7bcd38c30ad8d0289c5da5ffe94172b49f4"}],"sha":"7fe16e9df7f6aba413a134e1eeb6bb8e3f47c082","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/7fe16e9df7f6aba413a134e1eeb6bb8e3f47c082"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/a084a7bcd38c30ad8d0289c5da5ffe94172b49f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:50:11Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:50:11Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"message":"Step 6: Spring Cloud Netflix Eureka service discovery\n\nAdds a standalone eureka-server module (Boot 4.1.1 + SC train 2025.1.3,\nnetflix 5.0.2) and makes source/problem/evaluation services discovery\nclients. Internal cross-service HTTP calls now resolve the upstream by\nSERVICE ID through Eureka instead of fixed docker-DNS hostnames.\n\n- eureka-server: @EnableEurekaServer on :8761, self-preservation off\n- 3 services register (prefer-ip-address, EUREKA_SERVER_URL env)\n- Internal @HttpExchange proxies no longer use a global @LoadBalanced\n  RestClient.Builder bean (Eureka''s own registry transport auto-wires any\n  such bean -> circular \"No instances available for eureka-server\").\n  Instead a scoped ClientHttpRequestInterceptor injects LoadBalancerClient\n  and rewrites the service-id host via choose() + reconstructURI().\n- docker-compose: eureka-server service + EUREKA_SERVER_URL wiring;\n  base URLs moved to service-id defaults (http://source-service / problem-service)\n- gateway Caddyfile routes /eureka* to the registry (dashboard :8761)\n- @SpringBootTest on source-service now disables the eureka client\n\ne2e-verified: all 3 services UP in registry; evaluation->problem discovery\nvia POST /evaluation/cycles/{id}/route (GOVT->GOVERNMENT, cycle reached\nEVALUATION_IN_PROGRESS + assignment); problem->source discovery via POST\n/problems (201, sourceBucket GOVT resolved from sih_source).","tree":{"sha":"fca62afc97c4012f00efc0fe9cbe71072b099cd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/trees/fca62afc97c4012f00efc0fe9cbe71072b099cd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/commits/a084a7bcd38c30ad8d0289c5da5ffe94172b49f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/a084a7bcd38c30ad8d0289c5da5ffe94172b49f4","node_id":"C_kwDOUQcccdoAKGEwODRhN2JjZDM4YzMwYWQ4ZDAyODljNWRhNWZmZTk0MTcyYjQ5ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/50d9374f2de1c9cd257a9132fe13aeeaf9b009bd","sha":"50d9374f2de1c9cd257a9132fe13aeeaf9b009bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/50d9374f2de1c9cd257a9132fe13aeeaf9b009bd"}],"sha":"a084a7bcd38c30ad8d0289c5da5ffe94172b49f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/a084a7bcd38c30ad8d0289c5da5ffe94172b49f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/50d9374f2de1c9cd257a9132fe13aeeaf9b009bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:01:29Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:01:29Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"message":"Routing engine: bucket-based least-loaded auto-route after analyze\n\nPreviously the evaluation pipeline stopped at ROUTING — no evaluator ever\nreceived the problem. Now, immediately after analyze advances a cycle to\nROUTING, the problem is routed to the evaluator pool matching its origin\nbucket (GOVT→GOVERNMENT, INDUSTRY→INDUSTRY, COMMUNITY→COMMUNITY, HEI→HEI,\nCITIZEN→CITIZEN): exactly one ASSIGNED evaluation_assignment is created for\nthe least-loaded active profile under max_workload, the cycle moves\nROUTING→EVALUATION_IN_PROGRESS, and an EVALUATION_ROUTED audit row records\nthe handoff. No eligible candidate leaves the cycle at ROUTING (not an\nerror) for a later manual retry.\n\nPrerequisite: an ADMIN profile-onboarding endpoint (POST\n/evaluation/evaluator-profiles) — there was previously no way to create an\nevaluator_profile to route to. One profile per evaluator user (409 on\nduplicate), defaults maxWorkload=5 / active=true.\n\nAuto-route is orchestrated at the controller after the analysis service\nreturns (separate @Transactional boundary), so a routing no-op cannot roll\nback a committed analysis and ProblemAnalysisService stays untouched.\nConfig: app.evaluation.assignment-deadline-days=7 (lazy deadline).\n\nDB-free Mockito tests: EvaluationRoutingServiceTest (8) +\nEvaluatorProfileAdminServiceTest (3); existing 16 eval tests unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"74958a6ac2e122781bc1865ba908112d43eb68a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/trees/74958a6ac2e122781bc1865ba908112d43eb68a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/commits/50d9374f2de1c9cd257a9132fe13aeeaf9b009bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/50d9374f2de1c9cd257a9132fe13aeeaf9b009bd","node_id":"C_kwDOUQcccdoAKDUwZDkzNzRmMmRlMWM5Y2QyNTdhOTEzMmZlMTNhZWVhZjliMDA5YmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/6061bb50d1c1d1a66bdaf822370fff7169d70d5c","sha":"6061bb50d1c1d1a66bdaf822370fff7169d70d5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/6061bb50d1c1d1a66bdaf822370fff7169d70d5c"}],"sha":"50d9374f2de1c9cd257a9132fe13aeeaf9b009bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/50d9374f2de1c9cd257a9132fe13aeeaf9b009bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/6061bb50d1c1d1a66bdaf822370fff7169d70d5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:01:13Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:01:13Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"message":"Backend: ADMIN creates EVALUATOR accounts (POST /users/evaluators)\n\nEvaluators never self-register — an ADMIN mints the account directly with\nrole EVALUATOR and an OTP challenge for the evaluator''s first (only) login.\nShared AuthService.createUser() now backs both the public SUBMITTER register\npath and the admin evaluator path; phone conflicts return 409 either way.\n\nNew endpoint: POST /users/evaluators (ADMIN) -> EvaluatorOnboardResponse\n(userId, phone, role, OtpResponse). Unit tests cover the happy path and the\n409 duplicate-phone no-OTP branch.","tree":{"sha":"01ef36a5c6f23f62e8094ed4bdb66806c9d0e1aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/trees/01ef36a5c6f23f62e8094ed4bdb66806c9d0e1aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/commits/6061bb50d1c1d1a66bdaf822370fff7169d70d5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/6061bb50d1c1d1a66bdaf822370fff7169d70d5c","node_id":"C_kwDOUQcccdoAKDYwNjFiYjUwZDFjMWQxYTY2YmRhZjgyMjM3MGZmZjcxNjlkNzBkNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/8603572aaae9e918fb344c9bc66b2219761b1eab","sha":"8603572aaae9e918fb344c9bc66b2219761b1eab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/8603572aaae9e918fb344c9bc66b2219761b1eab"}],"sha":"6061bb50d1c1d1a66bdaf822370fff7169d70d5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/6061bb50d1c1d1a66bdaf822370fff7169d70d5c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/8603572aaae9e918fb344c9bc66b2219761b1eab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T17:13:03Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T17:13:03Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"message":"Step 5: source-service standalone (monolith retired)\n\nRename the last monolith module app/ -> source-service and run it against its\nown sih_source DB, completing the 3-service split behind the Caddy gateway.\n\n- Module rename: git mv app source-service; artifactId/name -> source-service;\n  Sih26043Application + context test -> SourceServiceApp/SourceServiceAppTests.\n- Re-based source-only migration: single V1__source_schema.sql (28 tables:\n  users/otp/refresh, problem_source + 19 JOINED subtypes, source_account,\n  source_registration + status history, source_verification, idempotency_key).\n  Drops all problem/eval tables and cross-DB FKs; enum types are native PG.\n- Config: source-service application.yaml (port 8081, DB sih_source) carries\n  only app.jwt/otp/refresh-token/identity-pepper; evidence/llm/evaluation\n  config stays with the services that use it.\n- docker-compose: app service -> source-service (DB sih_source, image\n  sih26043-source-service:step5); problem-service SOURCE_SERVICE_URL ->\n  http://source-service:8081; db bootstrap drops legacy sih26043 default DB\n  (healthcheck pins the always-present ''postgres'' db); .dockerignore +\n  Dockerfile.app jar default retargeted. Old app container retired.\n- gateway/Caddyfile: route table now uses explicit bare + ''/*'' path tokens\n  (path_prefix is not a Caddy matcher) so POST /registration,\n  GET /reviewer/registrations, GET /source/accounts, /audit and /domains all\n  reach their service; default fallback -> source-service.\n- Verified e2e through gateway:8080 across all three DBs - register a GOVT/\n  DEPARTMENT source as a fresh submitter, reviewer approves (account ACTIVE/\n  VERIFIED), submit problem (authz via source-service /internal/source-accounts),\n  walk status to REGISTERED, upload evidence to the shared volume, evaluation\n  start -> heuristic analysis -> cycle ROUTING. Rows confirmed in sih_source,\n  sih_problem, sih_eval. Tests green: source 1/1, problem 5/5, eval 16/16.","tree":{"sha":"2bdd1aedac99809751d9aec94d13eb1c6ab0f397","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/trees/2bdd1aedac99809751d9aec94d13eb1c6ab0f397"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/commits/8603572aaae9e918fb344c9bc66b2219761b1eab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/8603572aaae9e918fb344c9bc66b2219761b1eab","node_id":"C_kwDOUQcccdoAKDg2MDM1NzJhYWFlOWU5MThmYjM0NGM5YmM2NmIyMjE5NzYxYjFlYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/5104f1816266de8ddfda785ae87063de6acfab3a","sha":"5104f1816266de8ddfda785ae87063de6acfab3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/5104f1816266de8ddfda785ae87063de6acfab3a"}],"sha":"8603572aaae9e918fb344c9bc66b2219761b1eab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/8603572aaae9e918fb344c9bc66b2219761b1eab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/5104f1816266de8ddfda785ae87063de6acfab3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T16:37:45Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T16:37:45Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"message":"Step 4: extract problem-service (monolith → microservices)\n\nThe problem aggregate leaves the monolith for its own service and DB.\n\nproblem-service (:8082, db sih_problem):\n- Moves entity/repository/service/web/DTO code that owns domain, problem,\n  location, evidence, problem_domain and problem-scoped audit (git mv keeps FQNs).\n- Re-based Flyway baseline: V1 schema drops cross-DB FKs (source_id,\n  source_account_id, submitted_by_user_id, uploaded_by_user_id become plain\n  UUIDs) and drops PostGIS geometry; V2 re-seeds the 44 domains with the same\n  deterministic UUIDs as the monolith V6, so old/new DBs stay interchangeable.\n- Submission authz now calls source data over HTTP:\n  GET /internal/source-accounts/{id} -> SourceAccountResponse (owner, status,\n  verification, canSubmit, bucket/type), served by the monolith until Step 5.\n  ProblemCollectionEngine owner-checks + canSubmit()s + denormalizes bucket/type.\n- SourceAccountGateway maps 404/5xx/network failures to 404/502/503 ApiException.\n\nRetired (locked decision): SourceVerificationService no longer advances\nproblem.status SOURCE_VERIFYING -> SOURCE_VERIFIED. Verification now only marks\nthe source; problem triage is walked manually by reviewers via PATCH status.\n\nGateway routes /domains /problems /audit to problem-service; evaluation-service''s\ninternal problem-context call now targets problem-service instead of the monolith.\n\nVerified end-to-end through the gateway: public /domains tree (44), problem\nsubmit -> status walk to REGISTERED -> evidence upload (shared volume) ->\nevaluation start/analyze (heuristic fallback), rows landing in sih_problem /\nsih_eval as expected.","tree":{"sha":"0881c6ce295969d316a686069810a7bcfbb9a7d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/trees/0881c6ce295969d316a686069810a7bcfbb9a7d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/commits/5104f1816266de8ddfda785ae87063de6acfab3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/5104f1816266de8ddfda785ae87063de6acfab3a","node_id":"C_kwDOUQcccdoAKDUxMDRmMTgxNjI2NmRlOGRkZmRhNzg1YWU4NzA2M2RlNmFjZmFiM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/991a18b33fb86da33c17ac5aae588fc7d6ca06cc","sha":"991a18b33fb86da33c17ac5aae588fc7d6ca06cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/991a18b33fb86da33c17ac5aae588fc7d6ca06cc"}],"sha":"5104f1816266de8ddfda785ae87063de6acfab3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/5104f1816266de8ddfda785ae87063de6acfab3a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/991a18b33fb86da33c17ac5aae588fc7d6ca06cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T15:48:08Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T15:48:08Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"message":"Step 3: extract evaluation-service (monolith → microservices)\n\nExtract the Phase-2 evaluation engine out of the monolith into its own\ndeployable service with a dedicated sih_eval database.\n\n- New evaluation-service module (:8083): evaluation entities/repos/services,\n  EvaluationAdminController, analysis clients (Claude + heuristic fallback),\n  local security config, and its own re-based Flyway set (V1 schema w/ native\n  enum types, V2 seed). Cross-DB FKs are dropped to plain UUID columns.\n- Service-local generic audit_log (entity_type/entity_id) replaces the global\n  problem_id-keyed table for eval events (plan §5.4).\n- Strangler seam: monolith (app) now serves GET /internal/problems/{id} via\n  InternalProblemController + ProblemContextService; evaluation-service calls\n  it through an @HttpExchange client (ProblemContextApi/ProblemClientConfig)\n  wrapped by ProblemContextGateway (404/502/503 translation). Shared DTO\n  ProblemContextResponse lives in edith-common. /internal/** is permitAll.\n- EvaluationIntakeService/ProblemAnalysisService rewritten to consume the\n  context DTO and write local audit entries.\n- Docker: compose gains evaluation-service (sih_eval DB), gateway routes\n  /evaluation/* to :8083, Dockerfile.app parameterized by JAR_FILE,\n  db/init creates sih_source/sih_problem/sih_eval on fresh volumes.\n\nVerified: reactor test-compile clean; 16 eval unit tests green; stack boots\nwith Flyway v2 on sih_eval; end-to-end through gateway:8080 start→analyze\nproduces a heuristic ProblemAnalysis and advances the cycle to ROUTING, with\nrows in sih_eval (cycles/history/analysis/audit).","tree":{"sha":"85ea5c46101e16ccb1756d9b8fcf2cfa346b9688","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/trees/85ea5c46101e16ccb1756d9b8fcf2cfa346b9688"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/commits/991a18b33fb86da33c17ac5aae588fc7d6ca06cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/991a18b33fb86da33c17ac5aae588fc7d6ca06cc","node_id":"C_kwDOUQcccdoAKDk5MWExOGIzM2ZiODZkYTMzYzE3YWM1YWFlNTg4ZmM3ZDZjYTA2Y2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/81bb4cad15e3f14c7811552c9a13d9b4f6c753ac","sha":"81bb4cad15e3f14c7811552c9a13d9b4f6c753ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/81bb4cad15e3f14c7811552c9a13d9b4f6c753ac"}],"sha":"991a18b33fb86da33c17ac5aae588fc7d6ca06cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/991a18b33fb86da33c17ac5aae588fc7d6ca06cc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/81bb4cad15e3f14c7811552c9a13d9b4f6c753ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:52:46Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:52:46Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"message":"Step 2: gateway fronts the monolith (Caddy) + docker-compose stack\n\nStand up a gateway on :8080 in front of the still-monolithic app, which now\nruns on :8081, with a PostGIS DB behind it — no frontend or business-code\nchanges, the three static UIs keep pointing at http://localhost:8080.\n\n- gateway/Caddyfile: static L7 route table. The path contract is pre-wired\n  per future service (source / problem / evaluation prefix groups), but every\n  group still reverse_proxies to `app:8081` today. Extracting a service later\n  is a one-line upstream swap per group.\n- docker-compose.yml: db (postgis/postgis:16-3.4, healthcheck), app (thin\n  image over the host-built fat jar, SERVER_PORT 8081, per-service env),\n  gateway (caddy:2, mounts the Caddyfile, :8080->:8080). Named volumes for\n  pgdata and evidence.\n- Dockerfile.app + .dockerignore: thin eclipse-temurin:21-jre wrapper.\n  Build from repo root after `./mvnw -DskipTests package`.\n\nVerified end-to-end through the gateway (localhost:8080): public\n/registration/source-types 200; register -> OTP challenge -> verify-otp mints\na 273-char JWT; protected /registration/mine 200 with the SUBMITTER token;\nunauthenticated -> 401; ADMIN-only GET /users/{id} -> 403 for a SUBMITTER\n(correct business authz, not a gateway fault); swagger-ui + CORS preflight\n200 through the gateway. Full reactor test suite green: 21/21 (incl. the\n@SpringBootTest context-load against the live PostGIS DB, closing the gap\nthat Docker-down left in Step 1).\n\nThe stale pre-compose sih26043-pg container from 2026-09-05 was removed to\nfree the container name; its anonymous data volume (26e3a106...) was left\nintact (the old dev DB is retired by the plan; demo data is re-seeded via API).","tree":{"sha":"15cac5ff95e9d39e5eddcfc19beb3adf23c69a3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/trees/15cac5ff95e9d39e5eddcfc19beb3adf23c69a3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/commits/81bb4cad15e3f14c7811552c9a13d9b4f6c753ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/81bb4cad15e3f14c7811552c9a13d9b4f6c753ac","node_id":"C_kwDOUQcccdoAKDgxYmI0Y2FkMTVlM2YxNGM3ODExNTUyYzlhMTNkOWI0ZjZjNzUzYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/3a88cefea9de449d824c46d81c728dd0b1bd69ec","sha":"3a88cefea9de449d824c46d81c728dd0b1bd69ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/3a88cefea9de449d824c46d81c728dd0b1bd69ec"}],"sha":"81bb4cad15e3f14c7811552c9a13d9b4f6c753ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/81bb4cad15e3f14c7811552c9a13d9b4f6c753ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/3a88cefea9de449d824c46d81c728dd0b1bd69ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:39:37Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:39:37Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"message":"Step 1b: Maven multi-module reactor with shared kernel jars\n\nConvert the single-module Spring Boot build into a 3-module reactor while\nkeeping ONE runnable app (no behavior change):\n\n- edith-common (jar): all 63 enums + ApiException, FQN unchanged so app\n  imports keep resolving.\n- edith-security (jar): JwtService, JwtAuthFilter, AuthUser — the\n  claim-based JWT kernel; depends only on edith-common, spring-web,\n  spring-context, spring-security-core, jakarta.servlet-api (provided),\n  nimbus-jose-jwt 10.9.1 (line Spring Security 7 / Boot 4.1 resolves).\n- app: the rest of the monolith moved under app/ (entity, repository,\n  service, web, config, converter, resources, tests) + spring-boot-maven-\n  plugin for the runnable fat jar.\n\nRoot pom becomes a packaging=pom aggregator (spring-boot-starter-parent\n4.1.1) with centralized lombok annotationProcessorPaths in pluginManagement.\n\nVerified offline: reactor compile + test-compile clean; 20 DB-free Mockito\nunit tests pass across the reactor.","tree":{"sha":"0280b908ae02c2237bbec15921ea2bb3f0b2662a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/trees/0280b908ae02c2237bbec15921ea2bb3f0b2662a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/commits/3a88cefea9de449d824c46d81c728dd0b1bd69ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/3a88cefea9de449d824c46d81c728dd0b1bd69ec","node_id":"C_kwDOUQcccdoAKDNhODhjZWZlYTlkZTQ0OWQ4MjRjNDZkODFjNzI4ZGQwYjFiZDY5ZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/a10934731f156be4540b1704364535f0db05446a","sha":"a10934731f156be4540b1704364535f0db05446a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/a10934731f156be4540b1704364535f0db05446a"}],"sha":"3a88cefea9de449d824c46d81c728dd0b1bd69ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/3a88cefea9de449d824c46d81c728dd0b1bd69ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/a10934731f156be4540b1704364535f0db05446a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:31:53Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:31:53Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"message":"Step 1a: claim-based JWT — AuthUser principal, no per-request users lookup\n\nJwtAuthFilter now builds the Spring Security principal from token claims\n(sub, role, phone, kyc) via a new lightweight AuthUser, instead of hitting\nthe users table every request. JwtService is entity-free (issue + claim-map\nfrom AuthUser). Controllers/services swap @AuthenticationPrincipal\nUser -> AuthUser for actor params; DB User entity remains internal to\nsource-side services that genuinely own it (auth, registration, approve).\n\nPrepares the boundary so problem/evaluation services can authenticate\nwithout owning the users table.","tree":{"sha":"d47448ba43daff43f966bdc8ebd332f2fa7b7895","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/trees/d47448ba43daff43f966bdc8ebd332f2fa7b7895"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/commits/a10934731f156be4540b1704364535f0db05446a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/a10934731f156be4540b1704364535f0db05446a","node_id":"C_kwDOUQcccdoAKGExMDkzNDczMWYxNTZiZTQ1NDBiMTcwNDM2NDUzNWYwZGIwNTQ0NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/fef93614bde28cdfaab073cfdb4d6e305e7aadfa","sha":"fef93614bde28cdfaab073cfdb4d6e305e7aadfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/fef93614bde28cdfaab073cfdb4d6e305e7aadfa"}],"sha":"a10934731f156be4540b1704364535f0db05446a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/a10934731f156be4540b1704364535f0db05446a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/fef93614bde28cdfaab073cfdb4d6e305e7aadfa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:16:01Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:16:01Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"message":"Baseline: Phase-2 evaluation engine + frontends (pre-microservice split)\n\nSnapshot of the current working tree as the Step-0 revert point for the\nmonolith-to-microservices strangler. Adds the Phase-2 evaluation engine\n(cycles, AI problem analysis via Anthropic SDK with heuristic fallback),\nthree static frontends (actor-ui, registration-wizard, test-ui), dev CORS\nconfig, V10-V13 migrations, and evaluation unit tests.","tree":{"sha":"8941a391683f1945f740a465b2c7b5d4b2be2c3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/trees/8941a391683f1945f740a465b2c7b5d4b2be2c3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/commits/fef93614bde28cdfaab073cfdb4d6e305e7aadfa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/fef93614bde28cdfaab073cfdb4d6e305e7aadfa","node_id":"C_kwDOUQcccdoAKGZlZjkzNjE0YmRlMjhjZGZhYWIwNzNjZmRiNGQ2ZTMwNWU3YWFkZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/d179e64d282c5b8cb10bc1786c8873b9642a1a00","sha":"d179e64d282c5b8cb10bc1786c8873b9642a1a00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/d179e64d282c5b8cb10bc1786c8873b9642a1a00"}],"sha":"fef93614bde28cdfaab073cfdb4d6e305e7aadfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/fef93614bde28cdfaab073cfdb4d6e305e7aadfa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commits/d179e64d282c5b8cb10bc1786c8873b9642a1a00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:54:47Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:54:47Z","email":"ghuleyogesh856@gmail.com","name":"yogesh856"},"message":"Phase 1 backend: source registration workflow + source account spine\n\nInitial commit of the SIH26043 backend (Spring Boot 4.1.1 / Java 21).\n\nModule A (Source Management) and Module B (Problem Management) are joined\nby a single source_account spine: a registration approved by a reviewer\nopens exactly one account, and every problem is filed through it\n(1 SOURCE : N PROBLEMS). POST /problems therefore reads bucket and\nsub-entity type from the account server-side instead of trusting the\nrequest body, and an unowned, unverified, or suspended account is a\n403 SOURCE_NOT_VERIFIED.\n\nSchema is Flyway-owned (V1-V9) with ddl-auto: validate, so entity\nmappings are checked against the real schema at every startup.","tree":{"sha":"650f87d1376d991453a8acdd7d746423d263c3f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/trees/650f87d1376d991453a8acdd7d746423d263c3f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/git/commits/d179e64d282c5b8cb10bc1786c8873b9642a1a00","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196352799?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yogesh856","id":196352799,"login":"yogesh856","node_id":"U_kgDOC7QbHw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogesh856","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xdbhavik/Manthan-Churning-Ideas-into-Solutions/commit/d179e64d282c5b8cb10bc1786c8873b9642a1a00","node_id":"C_kwDOUQcccdoAKGQxNzllNjRkMjgyYzViOGNiMTBiYzE3ODZjODg3M2I5NjQyYTFhMDA","parents":[],"sha":"d179e64d282c5b8