thumbnail for shared LumaBrief links\n\nShared iMessage/Slack/LinkedIn links to luma-brief.vercel.app showed a bare\nURL with no title, description, or image. Fixed with:\n\n- public/og-image.png — a 1200x630 preview card in the app''s own colors,\n  rendered from scripts/og-image.html\n- scripts/inject-web-meta.js — a postbuild step run from vercel.json that\n  writes the title/description/Open Graph/Twitter tags into dist/index.html\n\nWent with a postbuild step over expo-router''s own src/app/+html.tsx\ncustomization point: verified by hand that +html.tsx is only invoked when\napp.json''s web.output is \"static\" or \"server\" — this project uses \"single\"\n(one prebuilt index.html, matching vercel.json''s SPA rewrite), and in that\nmode Expo always emits its generic shell and never calls +html.tsx.\nSwitching output modes to use it would touch how every route is built.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c32584849c5592b225a3ce81e6d8f8143518a0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isa3bel/Luma-Brief/git/trees/9c32584849c5592b225a3ce81e6d8f8143518a0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isa3bel/Luma-Brief/git/commits/62851b55e6e315ac71d8251f3cda21ef26a4408a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18249360?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/isa3bel","id":18249360,"login":"isa3bel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjQ5MzYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/