i.github.com/users/isa3bel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isa3bel/Luma-Brief/commits/1b082445969e6f73ec4317f9d6931c7934eab353/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:12:06Z","email":"isabelbolger@hotmail.com","name":"Isabel Bolger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:12:06Z","email":"isabelbolger@hotmail.com","name":"Isabel Bolger"},"message":"Add 6-digit code fallback for sign-in\n\nExpo Go''s exp:// deep link is dynamic per machine/session, so it can\nnever be added to Supabase''s redirect allow-list — the magic-link *link*\nliterally cannot complete sign-in there. Supabase issues a matching OTP\ncode alongside every magic link regardless, so this adds a \"enter the\ncode instead\" field after sending, verified via supabase.auth.verifyOtp.\nRequires the Magic Link email template to actually include {{ .Token }}\n(Supabase''s default template doesn''t) — see chat for the one-time\ndashboard edit needed.","tree":{"sha":"a9c0080c3c600d394722d30cb69c5d263f3d34d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isa3bel/Luma-Brief/git/trees/a9c0080c3c600d394722d30cb69c5d263f3d34d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isa3bel/Luma-Brief/git/commits/1b082445969e6f73ec4317f9d6931c7934eab353","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18249360?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https:/