,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isa3bel/Luma-Brief/commits/909b860a27752ebcc9c57804a9b0bd5272a1a64f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:09:07Z","email":"isabelbolger@hotmail.com","name":"Isabel Bolger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:09:07Z","email":"isabelbolger@hotmail.com","name":"Isabel Bolger"},"message":"Configure web export for Vercel deployment\n\n- web.output: \"single\" (SPA) instead of \"static\" — every screen is\n  auth-gated and fetches from Supabase client-side after mount, and\n  dashboard/[eventId] has no build-time-known IDs to statically\n  pre-render, so there''s nothing \"static\" output could actually do here\n- apps/app/vercel.json: build command, output directory, and a catch-all\n  rewrite to index.html so client-side routes survive a direct load/\n  refresh under SPA output\n- Documented the output-mode choice in README''s Known gotchas","tree":{"sha":"be09f85da7eb1a2f4ae3bcd94d5f5b8aa807f881","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isa3bel/Luma-Brief/git/trees/be09f85da7eb1a2f4ae3bcd94d5f5b8aa807f881"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isa3bel/Luma-Brief/git/commits/909b860a27752ebcc9c57804a9b0bd5272a1a64f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18249360?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/isa3bel","id":18249360,"login":"isa3bel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjQ5MzYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/received_event