2026-09-12T16:08:58Z","email":"isabelbolger@hotmail.com","name":"Isabel Bolger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:08:58Z","email":"isabelbolger@hotmail.com","name":"Isabel Bolger"},"message":"Introduce shared design tokens and redesign the app around Luma''s look\n\n- New apps/app/src/constants/design.ts: single source of truth for colors,\n  radii, spacing, and per-status pill colors, replacing hand-picked hex\n  values scattered across every screen\n- Applied across landing, sign-in, Dashboard (swipe deck + calendar +\n  blur), event detail, Network, and Settings — solid-color status pills,\n  consistent card/button radii, one accent color\n- Nav: side rail replaced with a top bar on wide layouts (Luma-style),\n  active link gets a pill highlight; top bar background is a soft\n  blue-to-white expo-linear-gradient instead of a hard border line\n- Fixed React Navigation''s default gray screen background (DefaultTheme''s\n  #f2f2f7) showing through as a seam under the new gradient top bar, by\n  overriding just that token app-wide instead of patching every Stack\n- Calendar: added keyword search over event title/description, reusing\n  the day-picker''s row component for results\n- Dashboard nav icon changed to a calendar glyph","tree":{"sha":"00b0b370df999dedeca14b3cc341f2319b1738c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isa3bel/Luma-Brief/git/trees/00b0b370df999dedeca14b3cc341f2319b1738c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isa3bel/Luma-Brief/git/commits/9e353078daaf107d938c6fa9d5fd04f38e0c9ff3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18249360?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/gists{/gi