m/users/isa3bel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isa3bel/Luma-Brief/commits/587f06fe4eb04e484dfae66caf91e30803d44995/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:08:45Z","email":"isabelbolger@hotmail.com","name":"Isabel Bolger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:08:45Z","email":"isabelbolger@hotmail.com","name":"Isabel Bolger"},"message":"Wire up real Luma sync, event enrichment, AI summaries, and Network scaffold\n\n- Settings: iCal URL field, Sync now button, enriched-count feedback\n- (app)/_layout.tsx: trigger a Luma sync once per session on sign-in\n- Dashboard: real isError handling (was infinite-spinner on a query error)\n- use-events.ts: real Supabase fetch/update implementations, replacing\n  the mock-only placeholders\n- Learnings tab: month picker, Generate/Regenerate summary, events-with-\n  notes list, mock-mode notice\n- Network: parked placeholder screen plus the underlying mock connections\n  table/types/format helpers, ready to switch on once there''s a real\n  LinkedIn data source","tree":{"sha":"be89f4efc5cc1d0dd9ddb7912667a4a6c7ff6ca6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isa3bel/Luma-Brief/git/trees/be89f4efc5cc1d0dd9ddb7912667a4a6c7ff6ca6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/isa3bel/Luma-Brief/git/commits/587f06fe4eb04e484dfae66caf91e30803d44995","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18249360?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isa3bel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/isa3bel","id":18249360,"login":"isa3bel","node_id":"MDQ6VX