moTech/commit/f73ceba9880ab280b7bbca84345eacf33fa6e91a","node_id":"C_kwDOUQyKwNoAKGY3M2NlYmE5ODgwYWIyODBiN2JiY2E4NDM0NWVhY2YzM2ZhNmU5MWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sidra-tahseen/ThermoTech/commit/89fd80bf8b354b9402211eec04c2fa24b22b17b7","sha":"89fd80bf8b354b9402211eec04c2fa24b22b17b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sidra-tahseen/ThermoTech/commits/89fd80bf8b354b9402211eec04c2fa24b22b17b7"}],"sha":"f73ceba9880ab280b7bbca84345eacf33fa6e91a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sidra-tahseen/ThermoTech/commits/f73ceba9880ab280b7bbca84345eacf33fa6e91a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267489517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamza1jaweed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamza1jaweed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamza1jaweed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamza1jaweed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hamza1jaweed","id":267489517,"login":"hamza1jaweed","node_id":"U_kgDOD_GQ7Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamza1jaweed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamza1jaweed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamza1jaweed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamza1jaweed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamza1jaweed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamza1jaweed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sidra-tahseen/ThermoTech/commits/63290800ea9c08c1124feec01a7960ac32d7b806/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T14:22:58Z","email":"hamza1jaweed@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hamza1jaweed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T14:22:58Z","email":"hamza1jaweed@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hamza1jaweed"},"message":"Add ML classification module (Phase 5)\n\nIntegrates the hotspot classification module at backend/ml/, plus the\nFastAPI routes and frontend API client that consume it.\n\nThe handoff data has 861 VIIRS hotspots with a 100% empty `label` column,\nso nothing can be trained yet. Two consequences shape this commit:\n\n- classify() falls back to a transparent rule engine (rules-v1) that\n  returns the identical JSON shape the trained model will. Backend and\n  dashboard can build against the contract today; when train.py runs, the\n  `model` field flips to xgboost-1 and nothing downstream changes.\n- Only 46/861 rows were queried against OSM, so near_* zeros mean \"never\n  checked\", not \"nothing nearby\". features.py converts those to NaN and\n  adds an osm_unknown flag rather than letting the model learn a fake\n  signal from 36 rows. road_distance is 100% NaN and is excluded.\n\nIncludes a 180-row review queue (data/labeling/) so one person can label\nin ~45 min and unblock training; see LABELING_GUIDE.md. train.py refuses\nto run below 60 labeled rows or 10 per class.\n\nnumpy is pinned <2 because shap 0.46 raises at import under numpy 2.x.\n\nVerified: `python -m thermotech_ml.selftest` passes, and the demo harness\non :8500 classifies all 861 rows (218 persistent / 400 other / 243 new).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"beedb20b276fb801e1f466e1c1676be1dc611c74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sidra-tahseen/ThermoTech/git/trees/beedb20b276fb801e1f466e1c1676be1dc611c74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sidra-tahseen/ThermoTech/git/commits/63290800ea9c08c1124feec01a7960ac32d7b806","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267489517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamza1jaweed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamza1jaweed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamza1jaw