ions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigincg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigincg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigincg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigincg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigincg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigincg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commit/fa3daabbe6838c999220fd52343e95fff5c52ef1","node_id":"C_kwDOUQzoo9oAKGZhM2RhYWJiZTY4MzhjOTk5MjIwZmQ1MjM0M2U5NWZmZjVjNTJlZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commit/b582ec644ecf3986c6de73a2f0a3ab2e69edc7ae","sha":"b582ec644ecf3986c6de73a2f0a3ab2e69edc7ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commits/b582ec644ecf3986c6de73a2f0a3ab2e69edc7ae"}],"sha":"fa3daabbe6838c999220fd52343e95fff5c52ef1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commits/fa3daabbe6838c999220fd52343e95fff5c52ef1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commits/b582ec644ecf3986c6de73a2f0a3ab2e69edc7ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T10:19:55Z","email":"bodhish@ohc.network","name":"Bodhish Thomas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T10:19:55Z","email":"bodhish@ohc.network","name":"Bodhish Thomas"},"message":"fix: scope the remote''s stylesheet to the plugin''s own subtree\n\nThe remote''s CSS is injected into the host page, which is itself a\nTailwind app with the same utility class names. Loaded second, this\nsheet''s plain utilities (`.hidden`, `.flex`, ...) won over the host''s\nresponsive variants (`hidden md:flex`) across the whole page and\ncollapsed its layout. Every selector in the built stylesheet is now\nnested under the root class `.care-dental-fe`, so the rules cannot match\nanything outside the chart and beat the host''s same-named utilities inside\nit regardless of load order. The dev harness keeps an unscoped sheet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"610227ad29d09fef00120b3c5f369e0b8923977b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/git/trees/610227ad29d09fef00120b3c5f369e0b8923977b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/git/commits/b582ec644ecf3986c6de73a2f0a3ab2e69edc7ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commit/b582ec644ecf3986c6de73a2f0a3ab2e69edc7ae","node_id":"C_kwDOUQzoo9oAKGI1ODJlYzY0NGVjZjM5ODZjNmRlNzNhMmYwYTNhYjJlNjllZGM3YWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commit/7d45f9d4857cc3d876d10bccf39bc144cdb3a8bb","sha":"7d45f9d4857cc3d876d10bccf39bc144cdb3a8bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commits/7d45f9d4857cc3d876d10bccf39bc144cdb3a8bb"}],"sha":"b582ec644ecf3986c6de73a2f0a3ab2e69edc7ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commits/b582ec644ecf3986c6de73a2f0a3ab2e69edc7ae"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commits/7d45f9d4857cc3d876d10bccf39bc144cdb3a8bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T05:34:52Z","email":"bodhish@ohc.network","name":"Bodhish Thomas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T05:34:52Z","email":"bodhish@ohc.network","name":"Bodhish Thomas"},"message":"docs: crop the README screenshot to the chart itself\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"084dee42b40f17d4526b2823c4018fa4287d3409","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/git/trees/084dee42b40f17d4526b2823c4018fa4287d3409"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/git/commits/7d45f9d4857cc3d876d10bccf39bc144cdb3a8bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commit/7d45f9d4857cc3d876d10bccf39bc144cdb3a8bb","node_id":"C_kwDOUQzoo9oAKDdkNDVmOWQ0ODU3Y2MzZDg3NmQxMGJjY2YzOWJjMTQ0Y2RiM2E4YmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commit/26f6b3123b5f1d0038cd881c93b5feab502fe2c4","sha":"26f6b3123b5f1d0038cd881c93b5feab502fe2c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commits/26f6b3123b5f1d0038cd881c93b5feab502fe2c4"}],"sha":"7d45f9d4857cc3d876d10bccf39bc144cdb3a8bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commits/7d45f9d4857cc3d876d10bccf39bc144cdb3a8bb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commits/26f6b3123b5f1d0038cd881c93b5feab502fe2c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T21:53:35Z","email":"bodhish@ohc.network","name":"Bodhish Thomas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T21:53:35Z","email":"bodhish@ohc.network","name":"Bodhish Thomas"},"message":"fix: build the remote on Vite 6 with host-referencing CSS\n\nThe federation plugin leaves its CSS placeholder unreplaced under Vite 8,\nso the remote could not be enabled; the harness''s preflight also rode into\nthe remote''s stylesheet and restyled the host page. The production input\nis now the manifest alone, the stylesheet compiles utilities against the\nhost''s theme tokens (theme(reference), no preflight), module preload\nhints are off, and the README documents the constraints.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"682fc30cc9d763b7d85ef5b0282c6517566d82f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/git/trees/682fc30cc9d763b7d85ef5b0282c6517566d82f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/git/commits/26f6b3123b5f1d0038cd881c93b5feab502fe2c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commit/26f6b3123b5f1d0038cd881c93b5feab502fe2c4","node_id":"C_kwDOUQzoo9oAKDI2ZjZiMzEyM2I1ZjFkMDAzOGNkODgxYzkzYjVmZWFiNTAyZmUyYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commit/5bb417b853c71e801ff852f68fbb82500ec2c696","sha":"5bb417b853c71e801ff852f68fbb82500ec2c696","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commits/5bb417b853c71e801ff852f68fbb82500ec2c696"}],"sha":"26f6b3123b5f1d0038cd881c93b5feab502fe2c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commits/26f6b3123b5f1d0038cd881c93b5feab502fe2c4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/commits/5bb417b853c71e801ff852f68fbb82500ec2c696/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T21:42:50Z","email":"bodhish@ohc.network","name":"Bodhish Thomas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T21:42:50Z","email":"bodhish@ohc.network","name":"Bodhish Thomas"},"message":"feat: dental chart (odontogram) structured question type for CARE questionnaires\n\nA frontend-only CARE plugin contributing one structured question type,\ncare_dental_fe.tooth_chart: an interactive FDI odontogram (permanent and\nprimary dentition, FDI/Universal numbering) with findings as brushes\n(caries, filled, missing, crown, root canal treated, fractured, mobile,\nextraction advised), tap/drag/quadrant marking, keyboard navigation, a\ntext summary and an optional note. The answer is stored on the\nquestionnaire response itself (persistence: \"response\"), so no backend\nchanges are needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c73879b7298bc60c6fa9f0a570445cc2bf8de47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/git/trees/1c73879b7298bc60c6fa9f0a570445cc2bf8de47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_dental_fe/git/commits/5bb417b853c71e801ff852