ed and over-capacity marks were only drawn on editable cells;\nthe brief shows them on the rolled-up person rows too. A cost typed\ninto an unpriced month now says why it was refused instead of merely\noutlining the cell. The move-under list shows each target''s path, since\na project can have two items called Design. The allocation that pushed\na month over capacity is named its cause, as the brief puts it, and the\ndetail panel takes its precision from DECIMALS like the grid does.","tree":{"sha":"3b858b6e0d1bbae7a21f634c1d1b72ebbf4aef6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francogarayokk/FE_case_study_innoscripta/git/trees/3b858b6e0d1bbae7a21f634c1d1b72ebbf4aef6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francogarayokk/FE_case_study_innoscripta/git/commits/c6c569639358c720dcbe399fd2c07516e3fdef4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66415085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/francogarayokk","id":66415085,"login":"francogarayokk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NDE1MDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/francogarayokk/FE_case_study_innoscrip