"francogarayokk"},"message":"fix(delivery): keep People''s rates across a reset, edit rows in place\n\nReset to seed also rebuilt Delivery''s copy of the register from the\nfixture, so the grid priced with seed rates until People next\npublished. That copy belongs to People and now survives a reset. An\nedited allocation is replaced in place instead of re-appended, so a\nperson''s row no longer jumps to the bottom of its item. The outage\nbanner states where the rates came from instead of inferring it from a\nper-session counter, and a month before the first rate record is marked\nin every unit, not only in cost.","tree":{"sha":"e3dccc317439c2efa7815bb3b8611b8ecd980769","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francogarayokk/FE_case_study_innoscripta/git/trees/e3dccc317439c2efa7815bb3b8611b8ecd980769"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francogarayokk/FE_case_study_innoscripta/git/commits/8bd7668d3062b4100bf954bacc9d933932d82e2f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66415085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/francogarayokk","id":66415085,"login":"francogarayokk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NDE1MDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://