k/FE_case_study_innoscripta/commits/87ba9232a9f13ded7e14d99a2fe9fb7fe61ff2ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T08:17:48Z","email":"francogaray94128@gmail.com","name":"francogarayokk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T08:17:48Z","email":"francogaray94128@gmail.com","name":"francogarayokk"},"message":"feat(delivery): unit conversions and largest-remainder rounding\n\nAllocations are stored in person-months only. toUnit and fromUnit\nconvert to and from hours, percent of capacity and cost at the edges,\nusing that person''s person-month for the month (weeklyHours x\nworkingDays / 5) and the month''s blended rate, so a cost typed into a\nmonth with a rate change divides by the blended rate. Switching units\nand back returns the stored value unchanged. DECIMALS fixes display\nprecision per unit: hours and person-months 2dp, percent 1dp, cost 2dp.\n\ndistribute() rounds a list of exact values to a fixed number of\ndecimals with the largest-remainder method, so the cells on screen\nalways add up to the total on screen.","tree":{"sha":"855425c6828b0c2f4eb872e55e36afb28c4897f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francogarayokk/FE_case_study_innoscripta/git/trees/855425c6828b0c2f4eb872e55e36afb28c4897f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francogarayokk/FE_case_study_innoscripta/git/commits/87ba9232a9f13ded7e14d99a2fe9fb7fe61ff2ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66415085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francogarayokk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/francogarayokk","id":66415085,"login":"francogarayokk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2N